<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">Thukhente</book>
  <para style="h">Thukhente</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thukhente</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thukhente</para>
  <para style="mt">Thukhente</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua a si zaw ciengin Topa kungah Israel-te in thu a dong vua, “Canaan-te sim dingin koi kuonto masa ding ka hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, “Judah kuonto ding hi. Ama’ khut sungah tua gam ka pie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah in a sanggam Simeon kungah, “Canaan-te sim dingin kei ei kipie gamah ei zui to in; kei zong nang ang kipie gam sungah kang zui ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Simeon in ama a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah kuonto a, Topa in a khut sung vuah Canaan-te le Periz-te a pie hi; tuale amate in Bezek khuo-ah mi tul sawm a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in Bezek-ah Adoni-bezek a tuoh vua, tuale ama tawh kido-in Canaan-te le Periz-te a zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adoni-bezek a tai hi; ahi vangin ama delin a man vua, a khutpi gel le a kepi gel a tansanpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adoni-bezek in, “A khutpi le a kepi a kitansan kumpi sawmsagite in ka sabuoi nei-a annengkiete tung ngai uhi; ka gamtatnasa bangin Pasien in kei ei thuh hi,” a ci hi. Amate in Jerusalem ah ama a peipi vua, tuale khum munah ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah mite in Jerusalem khuo simin a la uhi. Amate in namsau tawh vatin mei tawh khuopi a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Negeb gam sunga muoltung gam, le lei ngiemna sunga teng Canaan-te sim dingin Judah mite a kuonsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hebron (Hebron min pen nidanglai-in Kiriath-arba kici) a teng Canaan-te sim dingin Judah a kuon hi; tuale amate in Sheshai, Ahiman, le Talmai a zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum mun panin Debir (Debir min pen nidang lai-in Kiriath-sepher kici) a tengte sim dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Caleb in, “Kiriath-sepher simin a la zo poma a zi dingin ka tanu Achsah ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale Caleb’ naupa Kenaz’ tapa Othniel in tua khuo la hi; tuale ama in a zi dingin a tanu Achsah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama kungah tua nu a tun ciengin a pa kungah lo khat a nget nading tua nu a hasawl hi. A laa tung panin tua nu a kum ciengin Caleb in ama kungah, “Bang dei na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nu in ama kungah, “Letsong khat ei pie in; Negeb gam sungah keima nei koi ngalin Gulloth-mayim zong ei pie vet in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Caleb in zong Gulloth Tungnung le Gulloth Neinung a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses’ sungpa Ken minam Hobab’ suonlehlahte, Arad gei Negeb gama om Judah-te’ senel gamah Judah mite tawh lutu khuopi panin a peito vua, Amalek-te tawh a tengton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sanggam Simeon tawh Judah peiton a, Zephath-a teng Canaan-te zo-in a khuopi a susie uhi. Tuaci’n khumi khuopi’ min Hormah kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah in Gaza le a gam, Ashkelon le a gam, Ekron le a gamte a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in Judah ompi hi, tuale ama in muoltung gam teng luo a, ahi vangin zang gama tengte delmang zo lo hi, azieh pen amate in sia sakol leeng nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses in a gensa bangin Caleb tungah Hebron kipie hi; tuale ama in khum panin Anak’ tapa thumte a delmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanle Benjamin-te in Jerusalem-a teng Jebus-te na delmang lo uhi, tuaci’n tuni dongin Benjamin-te tawh Jerusalem ah Jebus-te tengton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bethel sim dingin Joseph’ innkuonte a kuonto uhi; tuale Topa in amate a ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joseph’ innkuonte in Bethel (tua khuopi min pen nidang lai-in Luz kici) ah thukante a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thukante in khuopi pana a pusuoh mi khat a mu ciengun ama kungah, “Khuopi lutna lampi ei lah in, hoitahin kang bawl ding uh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in khuopi sung lutna lampi amate lah hi; tuale amate in tua khuopi namsau tawh a vatmai vua, ahi vangin tua mipa le a innkuonte a suohtasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hit-te gamah tua mipa pei-in khuopi khat sat a, a min Luz ci-in a phuoh hi. Tuni dongin a min kici suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Manasseh in Beth-shean le a khuoneute-a tengte, Taanach le a khuoneute-a tengte, Dor le a khuoneute-a tengte, Ibleam le a khuoneute-a tengte, Meggido le a khuoneute-a tengte a delmang lo ziehin khum gam sungah Canaan-te a teng suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel-te a thahat ciengun Canaan-te thona-aana nasep a semsah vua, ahi vangin amate a delmang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ephraim-te in Gezer-a teng Canaan-te a delmang sih uhi; hizongle Gezer-a amate lahah Canaan-te a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun-te in Kitron-a tengte ahi a, Nahalol-a tengte ahi zongin a delmang sih uhi; ahi vangin amate lahah Canaan-te tengin thona-aana nasemte a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asher-te in Acco-a tengte, Sidon-a tengte, Ahlab-a tengte, Akzib-a tengte, Helbah-a tengte, le Aphik-a tengte, Rehob-a tengte a notmang sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />hizongle khum gama teng Canaan-te lahah Asher-te a teng uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in a delmang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naphtali-te in Beth-shemesh a tengte, Beth-anath a tengte notmang loin khum gama om Canaan mite lahah a teng zaw uhi; hizongle Beth-shemesh a tengte, Beth-anath a tengte pen amate dingin thona-aana nasemte a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amor-te in muoltung gamah Dan-te a notkia vua, zang gamah a peisuhsah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Har-heres, Aijalon, le Shaalbim-ah Amor-te a teng suoh vua, hizongle a tung vuah Joseph innkuonte’ khut gihtahin kinga-in thona-aana nasemte a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amor-te’ gamgi pen Akrabbim katona panin Sela le a tunglam teng pana kipan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Gilgal panin Bochim ah Topa’ vantungmi peito a, “Egypt panin kang peipito a, na pu na pate kungah pieh dinga ka kamciemsa leitangah kang lutpi zo hi. Keima in, ‘No tawh ka thuciemna ka palsat ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No lam panin khum gama tengte tawh thuciemna bawl sih un. A maitamte uh phelmang un,’ kang ci hi; ahi vangin kang thupieh na mang sih uhi. Bang bawl na hi uh ahei en un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in na mai panun amate ka delmang sih ding hi, ka ci hi. Ahi vangin amate pen na gal uh suoh ding a, amau’ pasien-te no dingin thang ahi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in Israel-te zosie tungah tam thute a gen ciengin mite kiko-in a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum mun Bochim ci-in min a phuo vua, khumi munah Topa tungah biehpiehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua in mite a peisah zaw ciengin a luo ding uh gam la dingin Israel-te a unpi-un a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua’ hin sung le ama sanga a sawt hinzaw upate zosie’ hin sung tungtawnin mite in Topa’ na a sem vua, Topa in Israel-te dinga a sep na lienpite a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa’ nasem Nun’ tapa Joshua kum za le sawmkhat a phahin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gaash muol leilu lam, Ephraim muoltung gam sunga om Timnath-heres khuo-a ama’ luona huom sungah ama a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tham loin tua khang mite zosie a pu a pate uh kungah a kigawm vua, amau’ nua-ah Topa hile, Israel-te dinga a septe hile a thei lo khang dang khat a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa muna-ah Israel-te siet gamtatin Baal-te a bie uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuale Egypt gam pana amate a peipi a pu a pate uh’ Pasien ahi Topa a nuasie uhi; amate in a kimkot vua mite’ pasien-te nua a zui vua, tuate mai-ah kunin Topa a lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in Topa nuasie-in Baal le Astartes pasien-te a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel tungah Topa a sin so a, a na uh a lahpieh le a na uh a sut mite tungah amate a pie a, a kimvel vua a galte uh tungah zua-in, tuaci’n amate in a galte a nang zo nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gal sim dinga a kuon sielun, Topa in a kung vua a genkholsa le a ciemsa bangin amau’ langkhatah Topa’ khut pangin hamsietna tungsah hi; tuale amate a lungdong mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin a na uh a lahpieh mite’ khut sung panin amate a hunkhie dingin Topa in thukhente a khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a thukhente uh’ thu nangawn a ngai nuom sih uhi; azieh pen amate in pasien dangte lunggulin tuate mai-ah a kun uhi. Topa’ thupiehte a mang a pu a pate uh’ na zui lampi panin amate a piel zuoi vua, a gamtat dan uh a zui ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate dingin Topa in thukhente a koi sielin Topa in thukhente ompi a, thukhente hin sung tungtawnin a galte uh’ khut sung panin amate a hunkhie hi; bangzieh ahei cile amate a gimsah le a bawlsie mite ziehin amau’ tauna a khuotuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongle thukhente a si sielin amate nuatawn kia-in a pu a pate sangin a sie zaw-in a gamta vua, pasien dangte’ nua zui-in a mai vuah kunin a bie uhi. A gamtatnate uh ahi a, a lungkhauhnate uh ahi zongin a khie tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te tungah Topa a sin a so hi; tuale ama in, “Tam mite in a pu a pate uh tunga ka thupieh ka thuciemna palsatin ka thu a ngai lo ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joshua in a si lai-a a nuasie minamte khat mama zong a mai vuah ka delpieh nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pu a pate un Topa’ lampi a zui bangun amate in a zui le a zui lo uh Israel-te ze-et nadingin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in tua minamte thakhatin delmang loin hen phot lai a, Joshua’ khut sungah amate a pie sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Canaan gamah galsimna a thei kha nai lo Israel-te ze-et nadinga Topa in a hen minamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Israel khang sawnsawnte in galsimna a thei nading, nidangin galsimna a thei ngai lote tungah galsim zie a hil nading beh ahi hi.) :
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philistia gamuh mi ngate, Canaan-te zosie, Sidon-te, le Baal-hermon Muol panin Lebo-hamath lutna cieng dong Lebanon Muol tunga teng Hiv-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Moses tungtawnin amau’ pu le pate tunga a thupiehsa ahi Topa’ thupiehnate, Israel-te in a mang uh amah ci a kithei nadingin tua teng pen Israel-te ki-zelahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Canaan-te, Hit-te, Amor-te, Periz-te, Hiv-te, le Jebus-te’ lahah Israel-te a teng uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amate in a tanute uh zi-in la-in amau’ tanute a tapate uh’ zi dingin a pie uhi. Amate in a pasien-te uh a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa muna-ah Israel-te a siet gamtat vua, Topa a Pasien uh mangngilin Baal-te le Asherah milimte a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel-te tungah Topa a sin so a, ama in Aram-naharaim kumpipa Khushan-rishathaim tungah amate a zua hi. Israel-te in kum giet sung Kushan-rishathaim’ na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle Topa tungah Israel-te a kiko ciengun Israel-te’ tanpa dingin Topa in Caleb’ naupa Kenaz’ tapa Othniel a khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama tungah Topa’ hlagau tung a, ama in Israel-te thu a khen hi; galsim dingin ama kuon a, tuale Topa in a khut sungah Aram kumpipa Kushan-rishathaim pie a, ama in Kushan-rishathaim a zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n a gam in kum sawmli sung tawlngahna a nei hi. Tua ciengin Kenaz’ tapa Othniel a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa muna-ah Israel-te a siet gamtat kia uhi; tuaci’n Israel-te do dingin Topa in Moab kumpipa Eglon a thahatsah hi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa muna-ah amate a siet gamtat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ammon-te le Amalek-te tawh kipawlin ama kuonin Israel a zo hi; tuale amate in lutu khuopi a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te in Moab kumpi Eglon’ na kum sawm le giet sung a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa tungah Israel-te a kiko ciengun Topa in amate hunkhie dingin Benjamin-te, Gera’ tapa, a veilawng pa, Ehud a khangsah hi. Israel-te in Moab kumpipa Eglon tungah ama tungtawnin sieh le kaih a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ehud in ama dingin a langni-a a hiem, tong khat a sau namsau khat bawl hi; ama in a puonnei a zietlam phei tungah tua namsau a khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Moab kumpipa Eglon tungah sieh le kaih a pie hi. Eglon pen a thau mama khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ehud in sieh le kaih a pieh zaw ciengin sieh le kaih a puohte a lampi vuah a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Gilgal kunga suong kikheng milimte opna panin ama kilekia a, “Kumpipa aw, nang adingin thusim gen ding khat ka nei hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa in, “Na dai vuo!” a ci-a, ama a cing zosie a kung panin a pusuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Innkhumzang a innkhan vot sungah ama tanga a to laitahin ama kungah Ehud pei-in, “Pasien kung panin nang tungah gen ding thu khat ka nei hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama a tona panin a dingto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ehud in a zietlam phei-a om namsau a veilam khut tawh manin Eglon’ gilpi a dawt hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a namsau banah a nambul tumsuh a, a gil panin a namsau dawh lo ahi ziehin a thau in a namsau tuommangin a eeh a lawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin talaap -ah Ehud pusuohin ama tunga innkhumzang innkhan kotte khahin tuate a kil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama a peizaw ciengin nasemte a pei uhi. Innkhumzang inndei kotkhah kikil a mu ciengun amate in, “Ama inndei vot sunga awng haw hi va,” ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n a ci nading uh thei lo za dongin a ngah vua, a innkhumzang kotte a hon tuon nai lo ciengin tawhtang la-in a hong uleh a pupa uh a sisa-in tuong tunga a lum a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate a kiheh kalun Ehud suohta-in suong milimte kalsan a, Seirah-ah tai-in a suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama a tun ciengin Ephraim muoltung gamah pengkul tum hi; tuale muoltung gam panin ama tawh Israel-te peisuhin a lutang dingun ama a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Ka nua ei zui un; bangzieh ahei cile Topa in na khut sung vuah na galte uh ahi Moab-te ang pie zo hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in a nua zuisuh vua, Moab peina Jordan tanmunte la-in koima’ galkai ding a phal sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khum hunin a thahat, a siem Moab-te zosie tul sawm bang a that uhi; a suohta koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-in Israel-te’ khut sungah Moab-te in guol lel uhi. Khum gam in kum sawmgiet sung tawlngah hun a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama zaw ciengin ciengzum khat tawh Philistia-te mi zaguh a that pa Anath’ tapa Shamgar a khang hi. Ama in zong Israel-te a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ehud a si zaw ciengin Topa muna-ah Israel-te a siet gamtatkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Hazor-a kumpi sem, Canaan kumpipa Jabin’ khut sungah amate a pie hi; ama’ galkapmangpa pen Harosheth-ha-goiim ah a teng Sisera ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin huna ngen dingin Topa tungah Israel-te kiko uhi; azieh pen ama in sia sakol leeng zakuo nei a, Israel-te kum sawmni sung nahpi tahin a bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hunin Lappidoth’ zi kamsang numei Deborah in Israel-te thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ephraim muoltung gam sung Ramah le Bethel kikala om Deborah lutu kung nei-ah ama to zel hi; tuale thukhensah dingin ama kungah Israel-te a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in mi sawlin Naphtali gam Kedesh panin Abinoam’ tapa Barak hlansahin ama kungah, “ Topa , Israel-te’ Pasien in, ‘Pei in, Tabor Muol tungah panmun la inlen, Naphtali minam le Zebulun minam sung panin mi tulsawm zawpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in Jabin’ galkapmangpa Sisera, a sakol leengte le a galkapte tawh Kishon Lui ah nangma tawh kimu dingin ka kaidawh ding hi; tuale keima in na khut sungah ama kang pie ding hi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Barak in tua nu kungah, “Nang tawh i zaw ding leh ka pei ding hi; nang tawh i zaw sih ding leh ka pei sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Kang zawpi valon ding hi; ahi vangin na peina ding lampi in nang minthanna ang tunpi sih ding hi, azieh pen Topa in numei khat’ khut sungah Sisera a pie ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Deborah dingin Barak tawh Kedesh ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Barak in Kedesh ah Zebulun-te le Naphtali-te a thuta hi; tuale a nua-ah galhang mi tulsawm kuonto uhi; tuale ama tawh Deborah a kuonto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in Ken-te Herber in Moses’ sungpa Hobab’ suon le hlahte ahi adang Ken-te tawh a kikhen a, Kadesh gei-a Elon-bezaanannim cieng dongah a puonbuh a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sisera kungah Tabor Muolah Abinoam’ tapa Barak, peito zo hi, ci-in a kigen ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sisera in a sakol leeng zosie, sia sakol leeng zakuo, le ama tawh a omton galkap zosie, Horosheth-ha-goiim panin Kishon Lui-ah a thuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Deborah in Barak kungah, “Peito in! Bangzieh ahei cile tuni pen Topa in na khut sungah Sisera ang pieh ni ahi hi. Na mai-ah Topa pei tahtah hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama a zui galhang tul sawm tawh Tabor Muol panin Barak a peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in Barak mai-ah Sisera le a sakol leeng zosie le a galkap zosie a patausah hi; a sakol leeng tung panin Sisera kumsuhin a keng tawh taimang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua lai tahin Barak in a sakol leengte le a galkapte Harosheth-ha-goiim cieng dong del hi. Sisera’ galkapte a unpi-un namsau tawh a sigam uhi; a suohta koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in Ken-te Heber’ zi Jael’ puonbuh -ah a keng guohin Sisera a tai hi; azieh pen Hazor kumpipa Jabin le Ken-te Heber’ be kikalah kilemna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sisera dawn dingin Jael pusuohin ama kungah, “Hing kihei in, ka pupa aw, kei lam hing kihei in; zau sin,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama zong tua nu lamah kihei-in puonbuh sungah lut a, tua nu in tuongpha puon tawh ama a khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tua nu kungah, “Ka dangta ahi ziehin hepina tawh ka dawn ding tui halkhat ei pie in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in bawngnawi koina savun thawl hongin a dawn ding tui pie-in ama a khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in tua nu kungah, “Puonbuh kotah ding inlen, mi khatpo ang pei-in na kungah, ‘Tam munah mi khatpo a om ei?’ ang ci leh, ‘Om sih,’ ci in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Heber’ zi Jael in puonbuh kilna sia hiem khat la a, a khutah seh khat tawi-in ama kungah damtahin pei a- gim seng kisa-in a kimut laitahin- a sia hiem in ama pailetin lei a bat dongin a ankhaibaw-ah khensuh a - tuaci’n ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Barak in Sisera a del ciengin ama tawh kimu dingin Jael pusuohin ama kungah, “Hing pei in, na mi sui kang lah ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a puonbuh sungah ama a lut hi; tuale a ankhaibaw-ah puonbuh sia hiem kikhenin a sisa-in Sisera na lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-in Pasien in Israel-te mai-ah Canaan kumpipa Jabin a guolelsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Canaan kumpipa Jabin a suhsiet masangin Canaan kumpipa Jabin tungah Israel-te’ khut a khauh semsem hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Deborah le Abinoam’ tapa Barak in khum ni-in la a sa vua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel ah a samte uh a sau ciengin, mite amate mama kiphal tahin a kipieh uh ciengin- Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Za un, kumpite aw; Na bil uh daw un, uliente aw; Topa tungah la ka sa ding a, Israel-te’ Pasien, Topa tungah la ngaih ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa , Seir pan na pei cieng, Edom gam pan na kuonkhiet cieng, leitung kiling a, vante in buosuhin meiite in tui a sungsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa , Sinai-a Pa mai, Israel’ Pasien, Topa mai-ah muolte a kiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Anath’ tapa Shamgar hun lai, Jael hun lai-in khuol honzinte khawlin, khuolzinte in lampelh a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel sunga lohlote a cithei vua, a galvan lahpiehte utawh a thau milmel uhi. Azieh pen Deborah aw, nang na khang a, Israel sungah nu bangin na khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tha pasien-te a kiteel ciengin, tunkotah gal a om hi. Israel tul sawmlite lahah lum le tei a kimu amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite lah panin kiphal tahin a kipumpieh Israel galkapmangte lamah ka lungsim a pei hi. Topa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A thu gen un, no laa kangte tunga tuongte, puonpha hoi tunga tote le lampi dunga peite aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tui phuola lasiemte’ awging in Topa’ guolzawna, Israel gam ama lohlote’ guolzawnate, khum munah a awiawi uhi. “Tua ciengin kul tunkotte ah Topa’ mite a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tho in, tho in, Deborah! Tho in, tho in, la khat sa in! Ding in, Barak, na galmatte peipi in, Abinoam’ tapa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin milien a omlaite peisuh uhi; Ama ading a thahat mite do dingin Topa’ mite peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephraim panin amate tua kuomah a kuon vua, nang, Benjamin, na unaute tawh ang zui uhi; Machir panin galkapmangte peisuhin, Zebulun panin galkap mangpa’ ciengkhut tawite a peisuh uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Issachar uliente, Deborah tawh a pei vua, Barak tungah Issachar a thuman hi; amate in kuom sungah ama a nuadel uhi. Reuben bete lahah lungsim ki-etcienna nasie tahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuuhonte ading theile tum ngai dingin bang dinga tuukhumnate lahah tuongbaang na hi ahei? Reuben bete lahah lungsim ki-etcienna nasie tahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jordan galkhatah Gilead om hi; tuale bang dinga Dan-te tembaw tawh om uh ahei? Asher-te tuipi pieu-ah a to lai vua, a kumsuhna mun vuah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun-te pen sina a simmawte ahi vua; Naphtali-te zong, gamlah a sanna munah tua bang ma ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kumpite kuonin a do vua, tua zaw ciengin Canaan kumpite in Megiddo tuite gei, Taanach ah a do uhi; amate in a kinuasie ngunte a nga tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Van panin aasite in a do vua, a lampi ciet panun Sisera do uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kishon guntui khang in amate tai a, a lomlen tuikhang, Kishon tuikhang in taimang hi. Ka hlagau aw, hattahin mainawt in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tua ciengin sakol a kopdien ziehin, sakol taite’ ketot gin in leithuong hot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in, “Meroz samsie in, a sunga tengte nasie tahin samsie in. Azieh pen Topa a panpi dingin amate ang pei sih vua, thahat pa dona-ah Topa a panpi dingin ang kuon sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Numeite lahah thupha nga pen Jael, Ken-te Heber’ zi, puonbuh sunga teng numeite lahah thupha nga pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in tui ngen a, tua nu in bawngnawi a pie hi. Tua nu in uliente’ zah kuongkum sungah bawngnawi thaukhal a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a khutah puonbuh khetphim tawi a, a zietlam khutah nasemte’ sehta a tawi hi; ama in Sisera khatvei sat a, a lutang satguoi-in, ama in satzanin a ankhaibaw a khen pailet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama bawhsuhin a pua a, tua nu’ kengbul ah ama a lum ta hi; tua nu kengbul ah ama bawhsuhin a pua hi; a bawhsuhna tua munah, ama pua-in a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tawlet pan Sisera’ nu khuodah a, vathang panin a en hi: ‘Bang dingin sakol leeng ang pei ding tu tanvei sawt ahei? Bang dingin sakol leengpei ginte hici kiheh ahei?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A numei pil pente in a thugen a dawng vua, a tahtahin ama le ama kidawng ahi bo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Amate in a kinuasie vante mu-in hawm hi lo uh amah?- Pasal khat in nungah khat ta ahiei, ni ta ahiei; a kinuasie puon kibumte Sisera ading, a kinuasie puon kibum kizemte, a kibum a kizem puon nite ka ngawng ading amah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tuaci’n na gal zosie a si sieng ta uhi, Topa aw! Ahi vangin na guolte pen a vanglietna tawh a suoh ni tawh kibang taheh,” a ci uhi. Tuale khum gam in kum sawmli sung tawlngah hun a nei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa muna-ah Israel-te a siet gamtat vua, Topa in Midian-te’ khut sungah amate kum sagi sung a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te tungah Midian-te a guolzo uhi; tuale Midian-te ziehin Israel-te in a kibuh nadingun muol tung tengah suonghawmte le mun muonhuoite a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel-te in khai a tu popo ciengun Midian-te, Amalek-te, le nisuona lam mite in a sim zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate do nadingin giephuol satin Gaza kim cieng donga a po lei pana piengte a suhsietpieh vua, tuaci’n Israel gamah neh ding khat zong hen loin tuu, bawngtang, le laa khat zong hen a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen amate le a ganhonte a kuonto uha, kauphe honpi banga a tam a puonbuhte uh nangawn a pua uh hi. Amate ahi a, a kalaohte uh ahi zongin kisim zo lo hi; tuaci’n amate a tun ciengun khum gam teng a susie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Midian-te ziehin Israel-te nahpi tahin kiniemkoi hi; tuale Israel-te’ Topa tungah huna ngenin amate a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midian-te ziehin Israel-te’ Topa tungah a kiko ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te kungah kamsang khat a sawl hi; tuale ama in a kung vuah, “Israel-te’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in saltanna gam Egypt panin note kang peipi to hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale Egypt-te’ khut sung pan le ang bawlsie mi zosiete’ khut sung panin kang hunkhie a, na mai vuah amate delmangin a gam uh kang pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale keima in na kung vuah, ‘Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi; note in na tenna gam vua Amor-te’ pasien-te na zatah sih ding uhi,’ kang ci hi. Ahi vangin ka thu na ngai sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi pei-in Ophrah-a Abiezer-te Joash’ neisa ahi gangpi sing phungah to a, tua laitahin Joash’ tapa Gideon in Midian-te mu lo dingin lengga suhna-ah mangbu a cil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi a kungah kilang a, “Nang a thahat galhang pa aw, Topa in nang ang ompi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gideon in ama kungah, “Pu aw, Topa in ko ei ompi ahile bang dinga tamte zosie ka tung vua hing tung ahei? Ka pu ka pate un, ‘ Topa in Egypt panin ei peipi to hi lo amah? ci-a a gengen uh a lamdang ama’ nasepte zosie hei-a om sieng dawh ta ahei?’ a ci hi. Ahi vangin tu-in Topa in ei nuasie zo a, Midian-te’ khut sungah ei pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama lamah Topa kihei-in a kungah, “Tami na thahatna tawh pei inlen, Midian-te’ khut sung panin Israel-te va tankhie in; keima in nangma kang sawl hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Ahi vangin pu aw, bangci bangin Israel-te hunkhie zo ding ka hei? Kei, Manasseh lahah be zawngkhal pen ka hi a, ka innkuon sungah zong a neupen ka hi bo hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Hinanle keima in kang ompi ding a, Midian-te a unpi-in na vatmai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Tu-in na maipha ka mu leh kei tawh a kiho mi pa khu nang na hina lim khat ei lah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kungah letsong puoh dingin hing pei-in na mai-ah kang koi masangsie tam mun panin na pei sin,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Nang kilekia masang ka na om ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n a inn ah Gideon pei-in keelno khat le annel ephah khat tol saw lo moh-in a bawl hi; ama in law sungah a sa koi-in beel sung khatah a satui koi a, tua teng gangpi sing phunga ama kungah peipi-in a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasien’ vantungmi in ama kungah, “Sa le tol saw lo moh la-in tam suongpi tungah koi inlen, a tungah satui sung in,” a ci hi. Ama in tua bangma-in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi in a khut sunga om ciengkhut dawn tawh sa le tol saw lo moh a khoi hi; tuale suong panin mei pusuohin sa le tol saw lo moh katum a, ama’ muna panin Topa’ vantungmi a mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi ahi lam Gideon in thei hi; tuale Gideon in, “Ei panpi in, Topa ! Bang ding ahei cile Topa’ vantungmi kimaituo-in ka mu zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in ama kungah, “Na tungah nopna om taheh; zau sin, na si sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gideon in Topa dingin tua munah maitam khat lamin tua khu Topa in kilemna ahi hi, ci-in a min a phuo hi. Tua khu Abiezer-te’ Ophrah khuo-ah tuni dongin a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in tuami zanin ama kungah, “Na pa bawngtangte sung pan kum sagi a pha bawngtang a nina pen la inlen, na pa’ nei Baal maitam phelin, a gei-a om a siengtho khuom phua in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale tam sung mun muonhuoi dawnah Topa na Pasien uh adingin maitam khat lamin suongte a ngaina bangin koi in; tua ciengin bawngtang a nina pen la inlen na phua ding a siengtho khuom sing tawh meihal biehna pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gideon in a nasemte mi sawm peipi-in Topa in ama tunga a gen bangin a bawl hi; ahi vangin ama in sunlai-a a bawl ding pen a innkuonpite le a khuo mite a giin ziehin zanlai-in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zingmawng phalvah kisemin khuo mite a thaw uh ciengin, Baal maitam kiphelin a gei-a khuom siengtho kiphua a, a kilamsa maitam tungah bawngtang a nina pen kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in, “Tami koi pen bawl ahiei?” ci-in khatlekhat a kici uhi. Thu kanin thu a dawh zaw ciengun amate kungah, “Joash’ tapa Gideon bawl ahi hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuomite in Joash kungah, “Na tapa in Baal maitam phelin a gei-a om ama’ khuom siengtho a phua ziehin ama ka tha thei nadingun na tapa hing peipi in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin Joash in a langkhatah a pang mi zosie kungah, “Baal adinga thugen ding na hi uh amah? Ahi sihle ama panpi-in hum ding na hi uh amah? Ama a panpi poma zingmawng ciengin kithat ding hi. Ama pasien ahile ama le ama kihun taheh. Bangzieh ahei cile a maitam kiphel zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin khum ni-in Gideon pen, “Baal in ama dem taheh,” a ci nopna ahi Jerubbaal min kivaw hi. Azieh pen Gideon in a maitam phelpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin Midian-te, Amalek-te le nisuona lama mite zosie a peiton vua, tuale Jordan galkai-in Jezreel Kuom ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hizongle Gideon tungah Topa’ hlagau tung hi; tuale ama in pengkul gingsah a, ama a zui dingin Abiezer-te kihlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in Manasseh gam zosie-ah kamtaite sawl a, amate zong ama zui dingin kihlan hi. Ama in Asher, Zebulun, le Naphtali-te kungah zong kamtaite sawl a, ama tawh kimu dingin a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gideon in Pasien kungah, “Na gensa bangin keima’ khut tawh Israel-te na tatkhiet ding lam ka thei nadingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />bucilna kem tungah tuumul lom khat ka koi ding hi. Tuumul tung behah daitui omin leilah zosie a na gaw leh, na gensa bangin ka khut tawh Israel-te na tatkhiet ding lam ka thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua bangma-in a pieng hi. A zing ciengin ama thobai-in a tuumul tui a hiakang leh tuumul panin daitui kuongkum khat dim a hiakang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gideon in Pasien kungah, “Kei tungah lungthah sin, khatvei ei hamsah lai in; tuumul tawh khatvei beh ei sinsah lai in; kang thum hi. Tuumul tung beh gawsah inlen, leilah zosie-ah daitui omsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khum zanin Pasien in tua bangma-in a bawl hi. Tuumul tung beh gaw a, leilah zosie-ah daitui a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jerubbaal (tua pen Gideon) le ama tawh a omton galkapte zingmawngin thobai-in Harod tuikhuh gei-ah giephuol a sat uhi; tuale Midian-te’ giephuol pen amau’ opna leilu lam, Moreh muol nei, kuom sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Gideon kungah, “A khut sung vuah Midian-te ka pieh nadingin nang tawh a omton galkapte tam luo hi. Israel in min phatna teng kei tung panin la-in, ‘Ka hatna in keima ei hunkhie zo hi,’ ci kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in galkapte’ zahin tangtawh inlen, ‘Zau le linga a om poma inn ah kilekia ta un,’ ci-in,” a ci hi. Tua bangin Gideon in amate sittel hi; tul sawmni le tulni kilekia-in tul sawm omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Gideon kungah, “Galkapte a tam na lai hi; tui opna-ah peipisuh inlen, khum munah nang adingin amate ka sittel ding hi. Keima in, ‘Tam pa tawh na kuon ding hi,’ ka ci ciengin nang tawh ama kuon ding hi; tuale, ‘Tam pa tawh na kuon sih ding hi,’ ka ci ciengin nang tawh ama kuon lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in tui opna-ah galkapte zawpisuh hi; tuale Topa in Gideon kungah, “Ui in tui a lie banga a lei tawh tui a lieh zosie a langkhatah na koi ding hi; tui dawn dingin khupdinin a kam sunga a khut koi zosie adang khatah na koi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lei tawh tui a lieh mi zathum pha hi; ahi vangin adang galkap zosie in tui dawn dingin a khupdin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Gideon kungah, “Tui a lieh mi zathum tawh kang hunkhie ding a, na khut sungah Midian-te kang pie ding hi. Adangte zosie a inn vuah peisah ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a khut sung panun galkapte’ tuithawlte le a pengkulte uh a la hi; tuale Israel dangte a puonbuh vuah peisah a, ahi vangin mihing za thumte a omsah hi. Midian-te’ giephuol pen ama’ opna nei kuom sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum zan ma-in Topa in ama kungah, “Tho inlen giephuol sim in; azieh pen na khut sungah kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na sim ngam sih leh, giephuolah na nasempa Purah tawh peisuh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua hile a thu gen uh na za ding a, tua zaw ciengin giephuol sim nadingin na khutte ang thakhauh ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin giephuola om galkapte galpanna munah a nasempa Purah tawh a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuom dung tengah Midian-te, Amalek-te le nisuona lam mite zosie a lum vua, kauphe bangin a tam uhi; tuale a kalaohte uh tam seng ahi ziehin tuipi gei-a senel bangin kisim zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gideon a tun ciengin mi khat in a guolpa kungah mang khat na gen hi; tuale ama in, “Mang khat ka man hi, tua ka mangin Midian-te’ giephuol sungah mangbuham tawh a kibawl moh lum khat ang kilia-in puonbuh ban a, tua puonbuh sat kha-in a pua hi; tua puonbuh kikhulehin tuolah a kiphengpha ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A guolpa in, “Tam pen Israel mi Joash’ tapa Gideon’ namsau lo adang hi vawt lo hi; Pasien in a khut sungah Midian-te le a galkap zosie pie zo hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gideon in a kigen mang le a khietna a zah ciengin ama in Pasien bie-in Israel-te’ giephuolah kilekia hi; tuale ama in, “Tho un; azieh pen Topa in na khut sung vuah Midian galkapte hing pie zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in mi zathumte pawl thumin a khen zaw ciengin a unpi-un a khut vuah pengkulte le a sungah meila kiguong beelhawmte a tawisah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ama in, “Kei ei en unlen, ka bawl bangin bawl un. Giephuol mong ka tun ciengin ka bawl bangin bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei le ka ompi zosie in pengkul kang tum ciengun, note in zong giephuol kimvel zosie-ah pengkul hing mut pai unlen, ‘ Topa le Gideon ading,’ ci-in awng un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gideon le a ompi mi zakhat in galvil a laita pen a kihlen laitahin giephuol mongah pei-in pengkul a mut uhi; tuale amate in a khut sung vua om beelte a satkeh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a pawl thumun pengkul mutin beelte a satkeh vua, veilam khut tawh meila tawi-in zietlam khut tawh a mut ding uh pengkul a tawi uhi; tuale amate in, “ Topa le Gideon ading namsau khat!” ci-in a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Giephuol kimvela a mun ciet panun a unpi-un a ding vua, giephuol sunga om mi zosie tai-in a tai kawmun a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pengkul zathum a tum ciengun, Topa in namsau tawh a galte zosie khatlekhat kivatsah hi; tuale Zererah lam manaw-in Beth-shittah cieng, le Tabbath gei Abel-meholah gamgi dongin galkapte a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naphtali, Asher, le Manasseh-te zosie sung panin Israel mite kihlan a, tuaci’n amate in Midian-te a del uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ephraim muoltung gam zosie-ah Gideon in kamtaite sawl a, “Midien-te do dingin hing kuonsuh unlen, a tuite uh Beth-barah dong le Jordan dongin lahpieh un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Ephraim mi zosie kihlan a, Bethbarah dong ciengah luite a la vua, Jordan zong a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midian-te makai nite Oreb le Zeeb a man vua, Midian-te a del kawmun Oreb suongpi-ah Oreb thatin, lenggasuhna-ah Zeeb that uhi. Jordan gala om Gideon kungah amate in Oreb le Zeeb’ lutangte a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ephraim-te in ama kungah, “Midian-te do dinga na kuon lai-in kote nei ciel lo khu bang dan a nei bawl ahiei?” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n amate in nahpitahin ama a mawsiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in amate kungah, “Note tawh tekah dingin ken tu-in bang bawl zo tuon ka hei? Abiezer lengga i law sangin Ephraim-te’ lengga sangh i khon ma hoizaw hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien in na khut sung vuah Midian makaite Oreb le Zeeb ang pie zo ta hi; note tawh tekah dingin ken bang ka sem zo tuon mawh ahei?” a ci hi. Ama in tam thu a gen ciengin ama tunga a lungthahna uh a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gideon le ama tawh a om mi za thumte, Jordan ah tungin a galkai vua, basamin a gil uh kiel mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Succoth-te kungah, “Kang thum hi, ka nuazuite mohlum halkhat pie un, azieh pen amate a husam ta vua, kei ka hi leh Midian kumpite Zebah le Zalmunna ka nuadel laitah ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Succoth uliente in, “Na galkapte moh ka pieh nadingun na khut sungah Zebah le Zalmunna a om zo ta amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gideon in, “Tua ahile hoi pai ei, Topa in ka khut sungah Zebah le Zalmunna ei pieh zaw ciengin gamlah lingte le lingkungte tungah na tahsa uh ka tuoncil ding hi,” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mun panin Penuel ah peito-in a kung vuah tam bangma-in a ngen leh Penuel-te in zong Succoth-te’ dawn bang ma-in na dawngkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Penuel-te kungah, “Guolzo-a kang kilekia tah ciengin tam tausang ka satguoi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in Zibah le Zalmunna-te, nisuona lam mite’ galkapte zosie sung pan a omlai teng, mi tul sawm le tulnga bang a pha lai a galkapte utawh, Karkor ah a om uhi; bangzieh ahei cile galhiem a tawi thei mi tul za le tul sawmni si zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihonte in a tot uh Nobah le Jogbelah nisuona lampi zui-in Gideon pei-in galkapte a sim hi; azieh pen a galte a kiging kha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zebah le Zalmunna tegel a taimang uhi; tuale ama in nuadel pai-in Midian-te’ kumpi nite ahi Zebah le Zalmunna manin a galkap zosie a patausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Galsimna panin Heres katona lam zui-in Joash’ tapa Gideon a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Succoth-te tangval khat manin thu dong hi; tuale tua pa in ama adingin Succoth uliente le upate sawmsagi le sagi a min a gielpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Succoth-te kungah ama va tung a, “Note in kei kungah, ‘A basam na galkapte moh ka pieh nadingin na khut sungah Zebah le Zalmunna a om zo ta amah,’ ci-a nei galgihna uh Zebah le Zalmunna tanah om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in khuo upate manin gam lingte le lingkungte la-in tuate tawh Succoth-te a tuoncil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in Penuel tausang satguoi a, tua khuomite zong that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Zebah le Zalmunna kungah, “Tabor-a na thate uh a bangci mite ahi vuoi?” a ci hi. Ama gel in, “Amate a unpi-un nangma a bang uhi; amate, kumpipa’ tate tawh a kisun uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in, “Amate pen ka sanggamte, ka nu’ tate ahi uhi; Topa a hing ahi ma bangin amate na hinkhawi hi locin ken zong note kang that sih ding hi,” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a tapa tapen Jether kungah, “Pei inlen amate va that ta vawi!” a ci hi. Ahi vangin tangval pa in a namsau dawh ngam lo hi, azieh pen ama naupang lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zebah le Zalmunna in, “Hing pei inlen ei that in; azieh pen pasal in pasal tha ma puo bo,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n Gideon dingto a, Zebah le Zalmunna thatin a kalaoh uh’ ngawnga hlade lim tawh kibang kizepnate a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in Gideon kungah, “Nang le na tapa le na tupa in zong kote ei uh ta un; azieh pen kote Midian-te’ khut sung panin nei hunkhie zo ta hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gideon in a kung vuah, “Note kang uh sih ding a, ka tapa in zong ang uh sih ding hi; Topa in note ang uh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gideon in amate kungah, “Na kung vuah kang nget nuom khat om hi; van kinuasie na lah sung panun bilba khat ciet ei pie un,” a ci hi. (Azieh pen tua galte Ishmael-te ahi ziehin kham bilbate a nei uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kiphaltahin tuate kang pie ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi. Tuaci’n puon a pha vua, mi zosie in a lah uh van kinuasie sung panin tua puon tungah bilbate a sep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a nget kham bilbate a gihna pen kham shekel tulkhat le zasagi pha hi. (Midian kumpite zah hlade lim kizepnate, khainiengte, puon dupsante le a kalaohte uh ngawng kimvela om ngawng-awte kisim lo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gideon in tua teng panin siempu puon khat bawlin ama khuopi Ophrah khuo-ah koi hi; tuale Israel-te zosie in tua munah siempu puon bie-in a pahtat vua, Gideon le a innkuonpite adingin thang khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te mai-ah Midian-te guol lelin a lu a phongkia zo nawn sih uhi. Tuaci’n Gideon’ khang sungin tua gam in kum sawmli sung tawlngah hun nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama inn ah Joash’ tapa Jerubbaal pei-in a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu-in Gideon in ama’ hin tehteh tapa sawm sagi nei hi, azieh pen ama in zi tampitah nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Shechem-a teng a meinu in tapa khat nei a, ama in a min Abimelech a phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joash’ tapa Gideon vuoisi a, Abiezer-te gam Ophrah khuo-a om a pa Joash’ hanah kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gideon a si zaw behin Israel-te kiheikia-in Baal-te tawh a pahtatkia vua, a pasien uh dingin Baalberith a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Israel-te in mun zosie panin a galte zosie’ khut sung pan amate a hunkhie Topa a Pasien uh a phawhkha nawn sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuale Jerubbaal (Gideon a kici) in Israel-te tungah a na bawlsa sil hoite zosie ziehin amate in Jerubbaal innkuonte tungah lungdamna bangma a lah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Shechem-a a nu’ sanggamte kungah Jerubbaal’ tapa Abimelech haw a, a nu’ be le phungte zosie kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Shechem-a ulien zosie’ zah dingin gen inlen, ‘Jerubbaal tapa sawmsagite in ang uh ding ule mi khat in ang uh ding, no adingin koi hoi zaw ahei?’ a ci hi. Kei na gu le na sa uh ka hi lam zong phawh un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n a nu’ sanggamte in ama tangin Shechem ulien zosie’ zah dingin tam thu teng a gen uhi; tuale Abimelech zui ding lamah a lungsim uh a hawi hi, azieh pen amate in, “Ama i sanggam pa ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baal-berith biehinn panin nguntang peh sawmsagi ama a pie vua, tuaci’n Abimelech in ama’ nua a zui, kimanna a nei lo le mi ngoltolte tua tawh a ciel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ophrah-a a pa’ inn ah ama pei-in suong khat tungah Jerubbaal’ tapa a sanggam sawmsagite that hi; hizongle Jerubbaal’ tapa tumpen Jotham suohta hi, a zieh pen ama kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shechem ulien zosie le Beth-millo khuo mite zosie a kikhawm vua, tuaci’n pei-in amate in Shechem-a gangpi song gei-ah Abimelech kumpi a suohsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jotham kungah tua thu a kigen ciengin ama pei-in Gerizim Muol dawnah ding a, nahpi-in kiko-in a kung vuah, “No Shechem uliente aw, Pasien in na thu uh ang ngaipieh nadingin ka thu ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni khat, a kumpi ding uh sathau nu dingin singkungte a kuon uhi. Tuaci’n amate in olive kung kungah, ‘Ko ei uh in,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Olive kung in a kung vuah, ‘pasien-te le mite kipatawina ka thaute nuasie-in singkungte uh dingin hing pei ding ka mah?’ ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin singkungte in theikung kungah, ‘Hing pei inlen, ko ei uh in,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle theikung in amate kungah, ‘Ka hlumna le ka ga tuituohte nuasie-in singkungte uh dingin hing pei ding ka mah?’ ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin singkungte in lenggui kungah, ‘Hing pei inlen, ko ei uh in,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle lenggui in a kung vuah, ‘pasien-te le mite a lungnuomsah ka zu nuasie-in singkungte uh dingin hing pei ding ka mah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n singkung zosie in thangling kungah, ‘Hing pei inlen, ko ei uh in,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thangling in singkungte kungah, ‘Lungsim tahtah tawh na tung vuah kumpi dinga sathau nei nu sawm uleh, hing pei unlen, ka hlim-ah hing bu un. Tua ahi sihle thangling kung pan mei pusuohin Lebanon taamtahte katum taheh,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin tu-in lungsimtah le zatahna tawh kumpi-in Abimelech bawlin, Jerubbaal le a innkuonte zong limbawlin ama’ sepsate tawh kituoha a gamta ma na hi uh amah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a zieh pen ka pa in a luong khamin gal hing do piehin Midian-te’ khut sung panin ang hunkhie zo uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ahi vangin tuni-in ka pa’ innkuon na ledo vua, a tapa mi sawmsagite suong khat tungah thatin, a sila numei tawh a nei a tapa Abimelech zong na sanggampa uh a hina hang tawh Shechem uliente tungah kumpi-in na bawl vua-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />keima in kang ci-in, note in tuni-in lungsimtah le zatahna tawh Jerubbaal le a innkuonpite tunga na bawl uh ahi po leh, note zong Abimelech tungah lungdam unlen no tungah zong ama lungdam taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ahi vangin tua bang ahi tahpi sih leh Abimelech sung panin meikuong pusuoh hinlen Shechem le Beth-millo uliente katum taheh. Shechem le Beth-millo uliente sung panin meikuong pusuoh hinlen, Abimelech katum taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sanggampa Abimelech a giin ziehin Jotham taimangin Beer khuo-ah pei-in tua munah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abimelech in Israel-te tungah kum thum sung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in Abimelech le Shechem uliente kikalah hlagau gilo khat sawl hi; tuale Abimelech tungah Shechem uliente a zuoutat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jerubbaal’ tapa sawmsagite tungah tatsietna phu a kilah thei nading, amate a that a sanggampa uh Abimelech, le a sanggamte tha nadinga ama’ khut a thahatsah Shechem uliente tungah amau’ sisan luonna paat a tun thei nadinga tami thu pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n Shechem khuo uliente in ama tungah a galbawlna-un muol dawn tengah a buhdap ding mi a koi vua, tua lampi-a pei zosie na suom uhi; tuale Abimelech tungah tua thu kipuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ebed’ tapa Gaal a sanggamte tawh Shechem-ah a kituon vua, Shechem uliente in ama a muong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate lo kuonin a lenggui panun lengga khawmin a cil vua, pawi a bawl uhi. Tua ciengin a pasien uh’ inn sungah lutin an ne tui dawnin omin Abimelech a zako uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebed’ tapa Gaal in, “Ama’ na i seppieh va-ia nadingin Abimelech koi hi a, ei Shechem mite koi i hi uh ahei? Jerubbaal’ tapa le ama’ ulien Zebul in Shechem’ pa Hamor-te’ na sem uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam mite ka khut nei hi uleh izaw! Tua hile Abimelech suon dawhin ama kungah, ‘Na galkap khan inlen hing kuon in,’ ka ci ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khuopi a uh Zebul in Ebed’ tapa Gaal’ kammalte a zah ciengin a sin a so hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in Arumah-a om Abimelech kungah kamtai sawlin, “En in, Shechem-ah Ebed’ tapa Gaal le a sanggamte ang pei ta vua, nang hing langpangin khuopi a tawhnawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in na ompi galkapte tawh zanin pei-in lozau-ah na buhdap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin zingmawng ni ang suo behin tho unlen khuopi sim un; a ompi galkapte tawh nang do dinga ang kuon ciengin a tung vuah na hi thei tawpin na bawl in,” cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abimelech le a ompi galkap zosie zanin a tho vua, Shechem sim dingin pawl li kisuo-in a buhdap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ebed’ tapa Gaal pusuohin khuopi tunkot lutna-ah a din ciengin Abimelech le a ompi galkapte zong a kibuhna panun dingto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Gaal in amate a mu ciengin Zebul kungah, “En in, muolvum panin mite hing kumsuh!” a ci hi. Zebul in a kungah, “Muol hlimte mi banga na mu hi bo va,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gaal hamkia-in, “En in, Tabbur-erez panin mite ang peisuh a, Elon-meonenim lam panin mi pawlkhat ang pei uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zebul in ama kungah, “A na ka sep nadingun Abimelech koi ahiei?’ ci-a na kisielna tu-in hei sungah a om ta e? Tu-in kuon unlen amate tawh kido un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n Shechem uliente mai-ah Gaal kuonin Abimelech tawh a kido hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Abimelech in ama del a, a mai-ah ama a tai hi. Kulpi tunkot lutna cieng dong mi tampi liemin a puamat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaci’n Arumah-ah Abimelech a teng hi; tuale Shechem-ah amate a ten thei nawn lo nadingun Zebul in Gaal le a sanggamte a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A zing ciengin lozau-ah mite a pei vua, tuale Abimelech kungah tua thu a kigen ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />a galkapte a peipi a, pawl thumin khenin lozau-ah a buhdap uhi. Ama khuodahin khuopi panin mite ang kuonkhie a mu ciengin amate do dingin kipanin a thatgam sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Adang pawl nite in lozau-a mi zosie gamdelin a tha laitahun, thakhatthu-in, Abimelech le a ompi a pawlte mai a nawt vua, khuopi lutna tunkotah na ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Abimelech in tua ni sung tungtawnin khuopi sim hi; ama in tua khuopi la-in a sunga om mite that hi; tuale ama in tua khuopi susie-in ci a the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Shechem Tausang uliente zosie in tua thu a zah ciengun El-berith biehinnpi, mun muonhuoi sungah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Shechem Tausang ulien zosie a kikhawmtuo ta uhi, ci-in Abimelech kungah kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuaci’n a ompi galkap zosie tawh Zalmon Muol tungah Abimelech a kuonto hi. Abimelech in a khutin hei khat la-in geupakang lomkhat sat a, tuate lato-in a liengko-ah a puo hi. Tua ciengin a ompi galkapte kungah, “Ka bawl nei musa bangun ka bawl bang bangin mallangin bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaci’n galkap zosie in geupakang a tom vua, amate in Abimelech zui-in mun muonhuoi sim nadingin a koi vua, mun muonhuoi mei tawh halin Shechem Tausang mi zosie, numei pasal mi tulkhat bang a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua ciengin Thebez ah Abimelech pei a, Tebez simin giephuol sat a, tua khuo a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua khuopi sungah tausang muonhuoi khat om a, numei pasal zosie le khuopi ulien zosie tua sungah tai-in kot a kikhalu vua, tausang khumvumah a kato uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tausang tungah Abimelech pei-in tua khuopi sim a, mei tawh hal dingin tausang kotkhah a nai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ahi vangin numei khat in Abimelech’ lutungah an gawina suongpeh tungnung khat khiesuhin a lugu a keh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ama in a galvan tawi tangvalpa mallangin hlanin ama kungah, “Mite in, ‘Numei khat in ama that hi,’ a ci lo nadingin na namsau dawh inlen ei that in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tangvalpa in a namsau tawh sun pailetin ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Israel-te in Abimelech si a mu ciengun a unpi-un inn lam a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tua bangin a sanggam sawmsagite thatin a pa tunga a khielna ziehin Pasien in Abimelech’ khielna a thuhkia ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />tuale Pasien in zong Shechem mite’ gitlonate zosie a lu tung vua tukia dingin bawl a, a tung vuah Jerubbaal tapa Jotham’ samsietna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abimelech zaw ciengin Israel-te hunkhie dingin Ephraim muoltung gam Shamir-a teng Issachar mipa Dodo’ tapa Puah, Puah’ tapa Tola a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Israel-te tungah kum sawmni le kum thum sung thu khen a, tua ciengin si a, Shamir ah kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama zaw ciengin Israel-te kum sawmni le kum ni sung thu a khen Gilead-te Jair a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in laa sawmthum tunga a tuong tapa sawmthum nei hi; tuale amate in tuni dongin Gilead gam sungah Havvoth-jair a kici khuopi sawmthum a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jair si-in Kamon ah kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa muna-ah Israel-te a siet gamtatkia vua, Aram-te’ pasien-te, Sidon-te’ pasien-te, Moab-te’ pasien-te, Ammon-te’ pasien-te, le Philistia-te’ pasien-te ahi Baal-te le Astaroth-te a bie uhi. Amate in tua bangin Topa nuasie-in ama a bie sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te tungah Topa a sinso a, Philistia-te’ khut sung le Ammon-te’ khut sungah amate zua a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua kumin Israel-te nuoizanin a bawlsie uhi. Jordan gungal Amor-te’ leitanga om Israel-te zosie kum sawm le kum giet sung amate in a bawlsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah, Benjamin, le Ephraim innkuonte sim dingin Ammon-te zong Jordan a galkai uhi; tuaci’n Israel-te nahpitahin a lungdong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa kungah Israel-te kiko-in, “Na tungah kang maw zo ta uhi, azieh pen ka Pasien uh nuasie-in Baal-te ka bie ta uhi” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te kungah, “Egypt-te le Amor-te, Ammon-te le Philistia-te kung panin note hing hunkhie hi lo ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sidon-te, Amalek-te, Maon-te in zong note ang bawlsie uhi; tuale kei tungah nang kiko vua, a khut sung panun note kang hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle kei ei nuasie-in pasien dangte na bie uhi; tua ahi ziehin note kang hunkhie nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pei unlen na teelsa uh pasien-te kungah kiko un. Na lungkham hunun amate kihunkhie sah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa tungah Israel-te in, “Ka maw zo ta uhi; hoi na sah bangin ka tung vuah ei bawl in; hinanle kote tuni-in ei hunkhie in!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate lah panin gamdang pasien-te paimangin Topa a bie uhi; tuale Israel-te’ gimthuoh a mu ding ama in a thuohzo nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin galhiem tawi dingin Ammon-te kihlan a, Gilead-ah giephuol a sat uhi; tuale Israel-te zong peitonin Mizpah ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gilead makaite khatlekhat in, “Ammon-te sim dingin koi kipan masa ding ahei? Ama Gilead-a teng mite zosie’ lutang hi ding hi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Gilead-te ahi Jephthah pen a thahat galhang khat hi a, numei pahtat khat’ tapa ahi hi. Jephthah’ pa pen Gilead ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gilead’ zi in zong ama tawh tapate nei hi; tuale a zi’ tapate a gol ciengin Jephthah a not dawh vua ama kungah, “Nang in i pa inn sungah bangma gou na luo sih ding hi; azieh pen nang numei dang khat’ tapa na hi bo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sanggamte kung panin Jephthah taimang a, Tob gamah a teng hi. Jephthah kungah mi ginalo teng a kikhawm vua, ama tawh mi bulu dingin a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hun tomkal khat zaw ciengin Ammon-te in Israel-te sim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ammon-te in Israel-te a sim ciengun Tob gam panin Jephthah la dingin Gilead upate a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jephthah kungah, “Ammon-te i do thei nadingin hing pei inlen ka lamkai-un hing pang in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jephthah in Gilead upate kungah, “Kei ei nuolin ka pa inn sung pana ei notmang no teng ma hi lo na hi uh amah? Tuaci’n tu-in na lungkham ciengun bang dinga kei kunga hing pei na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead upate in Jephthah kungah, “Bang bang ahi ta zongin tu-in nang lama ang kihei ka hi ta uhi. Kote tawh hing zawhton inlen Ammon-te do vai-in tuaci’n kote le Gilead-a teng mi zosie’ lutangin hing pang in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jephthah in Gilead upate kungah, “Ammon-te tawh kido dinga inn lamah nei peipikia vua, Topa in kei tungah amate ei pieh leh na lutang uh ka hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilead upate in Jephthah kungah, “I kikal vuah Topa teci hi ding hi; na ci bangin ka gamta tahtah ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gilead upate tawh Jephthah pei a, mite in amate tungah lutang le makai-in ama a koi uhi; tuale Jephthah in tam thu zosie Mizpah khuo-a Topa mai-ah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jephthah in Ammon-te’ kumpipa kungah kamtaite sawl a, “Ka gam sim dingin kei kunga nang pei nadingin kei le nang kikalah bang thu om ahei?” a cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ammon-te’ kumpipa in Jephthah’ kamtaite dawngin, “Egypt panin Israel-te ang pei lai-in Arnon pan Jabbok le Jordan cieng ka gam ei lahpieh zieh ahi hi; tua ahi ziehin tu-in thudamin ei piekia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jephthah in Ammon-te’ kumpipa kungah kamtaite sawlkia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Jephthah in tam bangin ci hi: Israel-te in Moab gam hitale Ammon gam hitale lahpieh lo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahi vangin Egypt panin amate ang peito lai-un senel gam tawnin San Tuipi ah hing pei-in Kadesh ang tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in Edom kumpi kungah kamtaite sawlin, ‘Na gam ei nawhsah in,’ a cisah uhi, hinanle Edom kumpipa in a thu ngai lo hi. Amate in Moab kumpipa kungah zong a sawl vua, hizongle ama a thukim sih hi. Tuaci’n Kadesh ah Israel-te a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin senel gam tawnin khuol a zin vua, Edom gam le Moab gam kimvelin pei-in Moab gam nisuona lampangah a tung vua, Arnon galkhatah phuol a sat uhi. Arnon gun pen Moab gamgi ahi ziehin Moab gamah a lut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in Heshbon-a kumpi a sem Amor-te’ Kumpi Sihon kungah kamtaite sawl hi; tuale Israel-te in ama kungah, ‘Ka gam uh zuon dingin na gam ei nawhsah in,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin a gam nawh dingin Sihon in Israel-te a muong sih hi. Tuaci’n Sihon in a mite zosie kaikhawmin Jahaz-ah giephuol satin Israel-te tawh a kido uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa , Israel-te’ Pasien in Israel-te khut sungah Sihon le a mipi zosie pie a, amate in a zo uhi; tuaci’n Israel-te in khum gam sunga teng Amor-te’ leitang zosie a luo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Arnon gun panin Jabbok lui cieng le senel gam panin Jordan gun cieng, Amor-te’ gam zosie a luo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in Topa , Israel-te’ Pasien in ama’ mi Israel-te hamphat nadingin Amor-te a zo hi. Nang in amau’ mun lahpieh sawm na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na nei dinga na Pasien Chemosh in ang piehte nei zaw lel lo ding na mah? Ko phattuom nadinga Topa ka Pasien un a na zawsa na zosie a luo dingte hi lo ka hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab kumpipa Zippor’ tapa Kumpi Balak sanga a gina zaw na hi amah? Ama Israel-te tawh kitawmaw ngai-in a kido ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel-te, Heshbon le a khuoneute, Aroer le a khuoneute, le Arnon gun dung khuopi zosie-ah a ten uh kum zathum hun sung tengin bang dingin tuate lakia lo na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang tunga a khiel kei ka hi sih a, kei tungah gal na bawl ziehin kei tunga a khiel nang na hizaw hi. Topa thukhen pa in Israel-te le Ammon-te kikalah tuni-in thu khen taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ammon-te’ kumpipa in ama kunga thu puoh Jephthah a thusim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jephthah tungah Topa’ hlagau tung a, ama in Gilead le Manasseh nawhin Gilead gam Mizpah-ah peisuoh a, Gilead gam Mizpah panin Ammon-te kungah a peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa tungah Jephthah in kiciemna bawl a, “Ka khut sungah Ammon-te nei pieh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ammon-te kung panin guolzo-in ka kilekia ciengin kei ei dawn dinga ka kot pana ang pusuoh popo Topa -a’ hi ding a, meihal biehna-in ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate do dingin Ammon-te kungah Jephthah galkai a, Topa in a khut sungah amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in Aroer panin Minnith kimnai cieng dong khuopi sawmni, le Abel-keramim cieng dong mi tampitah that hi. Tuaci’n Israel mite mai-ah Ammon-te a guollel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Mizpah-a ama inn ah Jephthah a tung hi; tuale ama dawn dingin tawm le dah tawh a tanu lam kawmin a pusuoh hi. Tua nu pen ama’ ta khat neisun ahi hi; ama lo buong tapa hile tanu hile adang a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tanu a mu bepin a puon ehkehin, “Ala, ka tanu! kei nei neusah mama hi; nang pen ka lungkhamna lienpi na hi ta hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa tungah ka kam ka kah zo ta a, ka kiciemna ka dawhkia thei ta sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua nu in ama kungah, “ Topa tunga na kam na kah zo tah leh na kam sung pana a pusuoh bangin kei tungah hing bawl lel in. Tu-in Topa in na gal Ammon-te tungah phu ang lahpieh zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuale ama in a pa kungah, “Kei tungah tam thu hing pieng taheh: Kei va pei-in muoltung tengah vah kawikawi-in kei le ka guolte in ngahnu siengtho ka hina ka va kaa thei nadingun hla ni sung hun ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in, “Va pei in,” ci-in tua nu hla ni sung a peisah hi. Tuaci’n ama le a guolte a dingkhie vua muoltung tengah a ngahnu siengtho hina a va kaa ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hla ni a cin ciengin a pa kungah a kilekia a, ama in a bawlsa a kiciemna bangin ama tungah a bawl hi. Tua nu pasal tawh lumton ngai nai lo hi. Tuaci’n khum panin Israel-te’ ngaina khat pieng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />kum khatin ni li sung kum simin Gilead-te Jephthah’ tanu ziehin a thum dingin Israel’ tanute a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim-te galhiem tawi dingin kihlan a, amate Zaphon galkai-in Jephthah kungah, “Ammon-te sim dingin galkai-in na kuontonpi dingin bang dingin ko ei ciel lo na hei? Na inn tawh kang buhal ding uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jephthah in a kung vuah, “Keima le ka mite in ko nasie taha ei bawlsie Ammon-te tawh buoina ka nei laitahun kang ciel vangin amau’ khut sung panin nei hun tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nei hut lo ding uh ka thei bepin ka hinna khamin Ammon-te do dingin ka na galkai a, Topa in ka khut sungah amate ei pie hi. Tua ahile bang zieha kei ei do dinga tuni-a hing kuonto na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jephthah in Gilead mi zosie khawmin Ephraim-te tawh a kido uhi; tuale Gilead mite in Ephraim-te a zo uh hi, azieh pen, “Ephraim-te le Manasseh-te lungsim sungah no Gilead-te pen Ephraim-te pana a taimangte na hi uhi,” a ci ngai zieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gilead-te in Ephraim-te a do vua, Jordan tanmunte a la uhi. A taimang Ephraim-te khatpo in, “Ei galkaisah in,” a ci sielin Gilead mite in a kungah, “Ephraim-te na hi amah?,” a ci uhi. Tuale ama in, “Hi sing,” a ci ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama kungah, “Tua ahile Shibbolet ci vawi,” a ci uleh ama in a manin lo thei lo ahi ziehin, “Sibboleth,” ci hi. Tua ciengin ama manin Jordan tanmunte-ah a that uhi. Khum hunin Ephraim-te tul sawmli le tulni a si hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jephthah in Israel-te kum guh sung thu khen hi. Tua ciengin Gilead-te Jephthah si a, Gilead gam sunga ama khuo-ah kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama zaw ciengin Bethlehem-a Ibzan in Israel-te thu khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in tapa sawmthum nei hi. Ama’ be pulamte tawh a tanu sawmthumte kinungsah a, a pulam panin a tapate adingin numei sawmthum a la hi. Ama in Israel-te kum sagi sung thu khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ibzan si a, Bethlem khuo-ah ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama zaw ciengin Zebulun-te Elon in Israel-te kum sawm sung thu khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zebulun-te Elon si a, Zebulun gam Aijalon ah ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama zaw ciengin Pirathon-te Hillel’ tapa Abdon in Israel-te thu khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in laa sawmsagi tunga a tuong thei tapa sawmli le tupa sawmthum nei hi; ama in kum giet sung Israel-te thu khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pirathon-te Hillel’ tapa Abdon si a, Amalek-te’ muoltung gam Ephraim-te leitanga om Pirathon ah ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa muna-ah Israel-te a siet gamtatkia vua, Topa in Philistia-te khut sungah kum sawmli sung amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan minam sung panin Zorah-te a min Manoah kici mi khat a om hi. A zinu pen a ciing hi a, ta nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua numei kungah Topa’ vantungmi kilahin, “Ta nei loin a ciing hi nan lacin gai-in tapa khat na nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in kidawm inlen lenggazu hile khamthei zucia hile dawn sinlen, a sieng lo khat popo zong ne sin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile nang in nau pai-in tapa khat na nei ding hi. Tua naupang pen a suo-a kipanin Pasien tungah Nazir mi ahi ding ziehin a lutungah mulmetna tukha lo ding hi. Philistia-te’ khut sung panin Israel-te hunkhie dinga kipan ding pa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua numei nu pei-in a pasal kungah, “Ka kungah Pasien’ mi khat ang pei a, a melpuoh pen Pasien’ vantungmi khat tawh kibangin dipkuot huoi mama hi; ama hei pana ang pei ci ka dong sih a, a min zong ei gen lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahi vangin ama in keima kungah, ‘Gai-in tapa khat na nei ding hi. Tuaci’n lenggazu hile khamthei zucia hile dawn sinlen, a sieng lo bangma ne sin. Azieh pen tua naupang a suo-a kipanin a si dongin Pasien tungah nazir mi hi ding hi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Manoah in Topa kungah thu ngen a, “ Topa aw, kang thum hi. Kote kunga nang sawl Pasien’ mipa hing peisahkia inlen, ang suoh ding naupang pa tawh kisai ka bawl dan ding uh ei hilsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien in Manoah thugen ngai a, lolai-ah tua nu a to laitahin ama kungah Pasien’ vantungmi a peikia hi; ahi vangin a pasal Manoah ama tawh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua nu nawtai-in a pasal kungah, “Khatveini-a ka kunga ang kilah mipa ang kilahkia hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Manoah zong ding pai-in a zinu zui a, tua mipa kungah pei-in ama kungah, “Tam nu kunga thugen pa nang na hiei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Manoah in, “Tu-in na thugen teng ang tangtun ciengin naupang’ hinkhuo ding bang hi ding a; ama in bang bawl ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in Manoah kungah, “Ama tunga ka gensa zosie numei nu na kipilvang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in lenggui pana a pieng khat popo ne thei lo ding hi. Ama in lenggazu hile khamthei zucia hile dawn thei loin, a sieng lo na khat popo zong ne thei lo ding hi. Ama tunga ka thupieh zosie a zui kul ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi kungah Manoah in, “Khawl phot tadi inlen, nang adingin keelno khat hing bawl va ung,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in Manoah kungah, “Nei khawlsah le zong na an hing nehpieh sih vang; ahi vangin meihal biehna ding na siem nop leh Topa tungah pie in,” a ci hi. (Azieh pen Manoah in ama Topa’ vantungmi ahi lam a thei sih hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Manoah in Topa’ vantungmi kungah, “Na thugen teng ang tangtun ciengin nang kang patawi thei nadingun, na min bang ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ vantungmi in ama kungah, “Ka min bang dinga nei dawh ahei? Tua pen a lamdang mama ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Manoah in keelno khat le an tawh biehna laton a, tuale ama tungah na lamdangte a bawl Topa adingin suong tungah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maitam panin vantung lamah meikuong a kato ciengin, Manoah le a zinu in a et laitahun maitam meikuong sungah Topa’ vantungmi kato hi; tuale amate a mai kunin leilahah a bawhsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manoah le a zinu kungah Topa’ vantungmi a kilaakia nawn sih hi. Tua ciengin Manoah in ama Topa’ vantungmi ahi lam a thei na bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Manoah in a zinu kungah, “Pasien mu zo i hi ziehin a si valon ding i hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin a zinu in ama kungah, “Ei tha sawm hi leh Topa in i khut sung panin meihal biehna le an tawh biehnate ei sanpieh lo ding a, ahi sihle ama’ thu zosie ei lah loin tam bang nate tu-in ei pulah lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua numei in tapa khat nei a, a min Samson a phuoh hi. Naupang khanglien a, Topa in ama thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa’ hlagau in Zorah le Eshtaol kikal Mahaneh-dan ah Samson hansuo ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatvei Timnah ah Samson hawsuh a, ama in Timnah ah Philistia numei khat a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin peito-in a nu le a pa kungah, “Timnah khuo-ah Philistia numei khat ka mu hi; tu-in ka zi dingin ei lahpieh un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle a nu le a pa in, “A tep kitanlo Philistia-te kung pan zi na lah nadingin na tanaute lah le i mite lahah numei khat beh om lo amah?” a ci uhi. Ahi vangin Samson in a pa kungah, “Ka zi dingin tua nu ei lahpieh teitei in, azieh pen tua nu in ei lungkimsah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nu le a pa in tam thu Topa kung pan ahi lam a thei sih uhi; bangzieh ahei cile ama in Philistia-te do nading paulap a sui laitah ahi hi. Khum hun lai-in Philistia-te in Israel-te a uh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nu le a pa tawh Timnah ah Samson a peisuh hi. Timnah lenggui lote-ah ama a tun ciengin humpi khanglai khat in na hawhsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama tungah Topa’ hlagau tung a, mi khat in keelno khat a balkeh bangin a khut guoh tawh humpi a balkeh hi. Ahi vangin tua a sil bawl a nu kung ahi a, a pa kungah ahi zongin gen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama peisuhin tua numei tawh kiho a, tua nu in ama a lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zaw a sawt loin tua nu la dingin peikia a, humpi luonghawm en dingin ama lampielin a en leh humpi luonghawm sungah khuoi na pul a, a zu na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a khut tawh tuate sawhin peisuoh a, a pei kawmin a ne hi. A nu le a pa kungah a tun ciengin ama gel themkhat hawmin a ne uhi. Hizongle ama gel kungah ama in humpi luonghawm sung panin tua khuoizu a lah lam gen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua numei kungah a pa peisuh a, tangvalte bawl dan ngaina a om bangin Samson in pawi khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite in ama a mu ciengun ama uop dingin mi sawmthum puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Samson in amate kungah, “Note kungah thu hahsa khat hing gen vang. Pawi bawl ni sagi sungin a thu mukhie-in bang ahei ci nei gen thei uleh saihadiel puon sil sawmthum le pawipuon sil sawmthum kang pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin bang ahei ci nei gen thei sih uleh saihadiel puon sil sawmthum le pawipuon sil sawmthum kei nei pie ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in a kungah, “Na thu hahsa ei gen in; ngai phot sei mah,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “A ne pa sung panin neh ding kimkhat pieng a, a thahat pa sung panin a hlum kimkhat pieng hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ni thum sungin tua thu hahsa bang ahei ci a gen thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ni li ni-in Samson’ zi kungah, “Ka kung vuah tua thu hahsa bang ahei ci ang gen nadingin na pasal zawl in. Tua ahi sihle nang le na pa’ inn mei tawh kang halvam ding uhi. Ko ei zawngtumsah dinga tam sunga nei hlat amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n a mai-ah Samson’ zi kapin, “Kei ei muda bo teh; ei ngai tahtah sih teh. Ka mite kungah thu hahsa khat na dong a, hinanle a khietna nei gen sih hi,” a ci hi. Ama in tua nu kungah, “En in, ka nu le ka pa kunga zong ka gen lopi bang dinga nang kunga kang gen ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawi bawl sung buppi ni sagi sung a mai-ah tua nu kap hi. Tua nu in ama kungah nget citahin a nget vangut ziehin a ni sagi ni-in a kungah a gen dawh ta hi. Tua ciengin tua nu in a mite kungah tua thu hahsa a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni sagi a cin ni, ni tum masangin tua khuomite in ama kungah a gen vua, “Khuoizu sanga hlumzaw ding bang hi a, humpi sanga hatzaw ding bang ahei?” a ci uhi. Tuale ama in amate kungah, Ka bawnglaa tawh lo hlo sih locin, ka thu hahsa na thei sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama tungah Topa’ hlagau khautahin tung a, Ashkelon ah a peisuh hi. Ama in tua khuomite sawmthum that a, a vante uh lahpiehin thu hahsa a gen thei mite tungah a pawipuonte a pie hi. A lung sosa-in a pa’ inn lam a zuonkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale Samson zinu zong a kinun ni vua a molie pa a kipie ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw a sawt lo mangbu lah hunin Samson in keelno khat puo-in a zi kunga haw dingin a kuon hi. Ama in, “Ka zi innkhan sungah ka lut nuom hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin a sungpa in ama lutsah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sungpa in, “Nang in ama nuol zo ta ci kang telcien hi; tuaci’n na guolpa zi dingin ka na pie ta hi. A naunu ama sangin hoizaw hi lo amah? Ama tangin na la sih ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samson in amate kungah, “Tutungin Philistia-te tungah sietna ka bawl le zong ei kimawsiet lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Samson pei-in ngie zathum man a, meila zong a la hi; tuale ama in ngiete a mei le a mei kimatsahin a mei uh kikalah meila a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in meilate a hal zaw ciengin Philistia-te’ ankung a polaite lahah ngiete hla a, buphaite le bukung a polaite, lengga umte le olive lote zong haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Philistia-te in, “Tam koi bawl ahiei?” ci-in dong uhi. Amate in, “Timnah-te’ mahpa Samson hal ahi hi. Azieh pen a sungpa in a zi lahpiehin a guolpa a na pieh dawh zieh ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n Philistia-te peito-in tua nu le a pa mei tawh a haltum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samson in a kung vuah, “Note’ bawl tami ahile kei ka kiciem hi. Na tung vua phu ka lah zawh masangsie ka ta sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a tawbuh a khelbuh uh satin mi tampi that hi; tuale ama peisuh a, Etam suongpi pawhkeh sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Philistia-te a peito vua, Judah gamah giephuol satin Lehi a sim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah mite in, “Bang dinga ko ei do dinga hing peito na hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi. Amate in zong, “Samson a hen ding le ama in ko tunga ei bawl bangin ama tunga bawl dinga ang peito ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Etam suongpi pawhkeh-ah Judah mite mihing tulthum peisuhin Samson kungah, “Philistia-te in eite ei uh lam na thei sih amah? Tua ahile nang in ko bang bawla nei bawl ahiei?” a ci uhi. Ama in, “Amate in kei tunga ang bawl banga amate tunga zong ka bawl ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Philistia-te’ khut sungah kang pieh thei nadingun nangma hen dinga ang kuonsuh ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi. Samson in amate kungah, “Noma mama in kei nei tha lo nadingun kei tungah hing kiciem un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Hi lo hi, nangma hing henin amau’ khut sungah kang pie beh ding vua, nang kang that sih ding uhi,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n khauhuol tha ni tawh ama henin tua suongpi panin a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lehi ah a tun ciengin ama dawn dingin Philistia-te awng kawmin a pei uhi; tuale ama tungah Topa’ hlagau khautahin tung a, tuale a khut tunga om henna khauhuolte mei in a kahtum anthul khau tawh kibang a, a khut panin a kihennate zungmang zieu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in laa’ khagu a tha khat mu a, a khut zahin tua khagu la-in tua tawh mihing tulkhat that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale Samson in, “Laa khagu khat tawh a lom a lomin, laa khagu khat tawh mihing tulkhat ka that hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thu gen a man zaw ciengin a laa khagu a paidawh uhi; tuale khum mun pen Ramath-lehi kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama a dangta mama a, tuale ama in Topa hlanin, “Na nasempa khut tawh tam guolzawna lienpi nei pie zo ta hi. Tu-in kei a dangta-a si ding le a tep kitanlo mite’ khut sunga pua ding ka hi ta amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in Lehi-a om kuoh sung munkhat pawhkehsah a, tua panin tui a phul hi. Tui a dawn leh a tha kidimkia-in a thakhaukia hi. Tua ahi ziehin khum mun En-hakkore kici a, tuni dongin Lehi ah a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale ama in Philistia-te’ uh hun sungin Israel-te kum sawmni sung thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samson, khatvei Gaza ah a haw le tua munah numei pahtat khat mu-in a luppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gaza-te kungah, “Tam munah Samson ang tung zo ta,” ci-in kigen hi. Tuaci’n amate in khuopi a imtawm vua, zan tungtawnin khuopi tunkotah ama a buhdap uhi. Zan tungtawnin sip dide-in a om vua, “Khuovah cieng dong ngah vai; tua zaw ciengin ama that vai,” ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin zankim dong cieng beh Samsom lum hi. Zankim ciengin ama tho-in khuopi tunkot kotkhahte le a khuom nite tu-in a kotgolhte le adang teng zosie tawh bot zuonin a liengko-ah tuate puo a, Hebron mai-a muol vumah tuate a puoto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Samson in Sorek kuomah a min Delilah a kici numei khat a ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua nu kungah Philistia uliente pei-in, “Ama hing zol inlen, ama ia-cipin zothaw-in ka nuoinet thei nadingun bang in ama tua ci thahatsah ahei ci thu hing thei in; tuale ngun tang peh tul le zakhat ciet kang pie ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Delilah in Samson kungah, “Bang pen in nang ang hatsah a, mi khatpo in bangci leh hing zo thei-in khau tawh hing hencip thei ding ahei ci thu hepina tawh ei gen in,” a ci hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samson in tua nu kungah, “A gaw nai lo thalkhau a tha sagi tawh ei hen uleh ka hat nawn sih ding a, mi maimai khat ka bang ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Philistia uliente in tua nu kungah a gaw nai lo thalkhau tha sagi a peipi vua, tua nu in tuami khaute tawh ama a hen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua laitahin innkhan sungah ama buh ding mite a om vua, tua nu in ama kungah, “Philistia-te in hing sim ve aw, Samson!” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in mei a suhkhah cienga a kitat zieu lel patkhaute bangin tua thalkhaute bottat zieu hi. Tuaci’n ama’ thahatna thusim kithei zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Delilah in Samson kungah, “Kei nei simmaw bawl a, zuouthu nei gen hi; nang bang hing kici hen thei ding hepina tawh ei gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in tua nu kungah, “Khauhuol a tha a kizang nai lo tawh ei hen uleh ka hat nawn sih ding a, mi maimai khat ka bang ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n Delilah in khauhuol a thate la-in tuate tawh ama henin ama kungah, “Philistia-te in hing sim ve aw, Samson!” (Mite in ama innkhan sungah buhdap uhi) a ci hi. Hizongle vaukhau bawsan bangin ama in a khut henna khauhuolte a botsan zieu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Delilah in Samson kungah, “Tu dongin nei simmaw bawl a, zuouthu nei gen hi; nang bang hing kici hen thei ding ahei ci ei gen in,” a ci hi. Ama in tua nu kungah, “Ka luzanga ka samtel sagite siemphei tawh gantonin ciempeh tawh khenkip lacin ka hat nawn sih ding a, mi maimai khat ka bang ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama a lup laitahin Delilah in a luzanga a samtel sagite la-in siemin gan a, ciempeh tawh khenkip hi. Tua ciengin ama kungah, “Philistia-te in hing sim ve aw, Samson!” a ci hi. Hinanle a kimutna panin khanglo-in a ciempeh, a siembu, le a siem a kaigawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in ama kungah, “Na lungsim nei pieh vawt lopi bangci dan a, ‘Nang kang it hi,’ nei ci thei ahei? Tu-in thumvei vilvel kei nei simmaw bawl a, ang thahatsah bang ahei ci nei gen nuom sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tawpna-ah tua nu in nisimin a kutkut ciengin, sina dong dingin ama a lunggim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in tua nu kungah a thusim zosie gen a, “Ka lu tungah mulmetna a tukha ngai sih hi; azieh pen ka nu gil sung panin Pasien dinga nazir mi ka hi tabo hi. Ka sam ei kiheupieh leh ka hatna in ei nuasie ding hi; tua hile ka tha zawm pai-in midang maimai khat tawh ka kibang ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a thusim zosie ei gen sieng ta hi, ci Delilah in a thei bepin ama in mi sawlin Philistia uliente hlansah a, “Tu-in hing kuonto ta un, bang ding ahei cile a thusim zosie ei gen sieng zo ta hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin tua nu kungah Philistia uliente a kuonto vua, a khut sung vuah sum a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua nu in a phei tungah ama a kimusah hi; tuale ama nu in mi khat hlanin a luzanga om a samtel sagite a heusah hi. Ama a thakieh kipan pai a, a hatna in ama a nuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in, “Philistia-te in hing sim ve aw, Samson!” a ci hi. A kimutna panin ama a khahlaw ciengin, “Nidanga bangin peikhie vangin kei le kei kithingin suohta na vang,” ci-in a ngaisun hi. Ahi vangin Topa in a nuasie zo lam ama in a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Philistia-te in ama manin a mit tegel a dawt thawppieh uhi. Amate in Gaza ah ama peipi suhin sumngo kol a bul uhi; tuale ama in thong sung angawina-ah an a gawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin a kiheu zaw ciengin a luzanga a samte khan ding a kipankia pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in amau’ pasien Dagon tungah kithoina thupi khat bawl dingin Philistia uliente kikhawmin a guol nuom uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in, “I pasien in i khut sungah i galpa Samson ei pie zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mite in ama a mu ciengun a pasien uh a phat uhi. Azieh pen amate in, “I pasien in eite khut sungah i galpa, i gam susie pa, tampitah ei that pa ei pie zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A lungsim uh a nop ciengin, “Ei guolnuomsah dingin Samson va hlan ta un,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n amate in thong sung panin Samson hlanin a guolnop nadingun a ki-apmaipi uhi. Amate in khuompi ni kikalah ama a dingsah uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale Samson in a khuta a kai pa kungah, “Ka kingap nadingin inndo khuompite ei thamsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua laitahin a inn pen numei pasal tawh kidim hi; Samson a ki-apmai laitah a en Philistia ulien zosie le innkhum zangah numei le pasal mi tulthum bang a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samson in Topa hlanin ama in, ” Topa Pasien aw, tami khatvei beh kei ei phawh inlen keima’ mit tegel ei dawt thawppieh Philistia-te tungah khatvei beh phulahna tawh ka thuhkia thei nadingin tu beh lienin ei thahatsah in, Pasien aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Samson in inndo khuompi nite zamin a zietlam khutin khat, a veilam khutin khat tuoh tu-in ama gihna tawh tua khuomte-ah kingam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samson in, “Philistia-te tawh ei sitonsah in,” a ci hi. A tha nei zosie tawh tha la dingin ama a kisang hi; tuale uliente le a sunga om mi zosie tungah a innpi a cimsuh hi. Tuaci’n a hin sunga a mi tha sangin a sina-a a mi tha tamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sanggamte le a innkuonpi zosie kuonsuhin a luong la-in a puoto vua, Zorah le Eshtaol kikala om a pa Manoah’ hanah a vui uhi. Ama in kum sawmni sung Israel-te thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim muoltung gamah Micah a kici mi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a nu kungah, “Ngun tang peh tul le zakhat ang kilahpieh zieha awsie na suo a, kei zahna nangawnah na gen pen khu keima kungah a om hi; keima lah ahi hi; ahi vangin tu-in nangma tungah kang piekia ding hi,” a ci hi. A nu in, “ Topa in ka tapa thupha hing pie taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ngun peh tul le zakhat a nu kungah a piekia hi; tuale a nu in, “Tam ngun pen a kisung milim khat a bawl dingin ka khut sung pan ka tapa ading Topa tungah ka siensuo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a nu kungah tua sumte a piehkia ciengin a nu in ngun tang zani la-in ngunseh pa kungah pie a, ama in a kisung sia milim khatin a sunpieh hi; tua pen Micah’ inn ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua mipa Micah in biehbuhno khat nei a, siempu puon khat le teraphim bawlin a tapate lahah khat siempu semsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Israel gamah kumpi om nai lo hi; amau’ hoisah bang cietin mi zosie a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Judah gam Bethlehem ah Judah be tangval khat a om hi. Ama Levi-te khat ahi a, khum munah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mi pa in a muna mun khat popo-a teng dingin Judah gam Bethlehem a nuasie hi. A nasep a zop thei nadingin Ephraim muoltung gam sunga Micah’ inn ah ama a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Micah in ama kungah, “Hei pana hing pei na hiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Judah gam Bethlehem khuo-a om Levi-te ka hi a, ten nading mun khat popo sui dinga ang pei ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Micah in ama kungah, “Kei kungah hing om inlen kei adingin pa le siempu hing hi ta’n; kum khatin ngun peh sawm, puon sil khat le na neh ding kang sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua mipa tawh omton dingin Levi-pa thukim pai a, tua tangvalpa ama kungah a tapate khat bangin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n Micah in tua Levi tanggvalpa siempu-in koi a, Micah inn sungah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Micah in, “Tu-in Topa in ka dau ei peisah ding hi, ci-in ka thei hi, bangzieh ahei cile Levi-pa ka siempu a suoh zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Israel sungah kumpi om lo hi. Khum hun lai-in Dan-te in a ten nading uh gam a sui uhi; bangzieh ahei cile khum hun dongin Israel minamte lahah amate luo ding gam kipie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Dan-te in Zorah le Eshtaol panin tua gam endap ding le a mukhie dingin amau’ be buppi sung panin galhang pasal nga a sawl uhi; tuale amate in tua mite kungah, “Va pei unlen gam va sui ta un,” a ci uhi. Ephraim muoltung gama Micah’ inn ah amate a tun ciengun tua munah a taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Micah’ inn ah amate a op laitahun a aw-in tua Levi tangvalpa a thei pailien uhi; tuaci’n amate pei-in ama kungah, “Nang tam munah koi hing puoh ahiei? Tam munah bang bawl na hiei? Tam munah na nasep bang ahiei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Micah in kei dingin tam bang tam bang teng ei bawlpieh hi. Ama in ei cielin ama’ siempu ka suoh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah, “Kang vaikuonna uh ka lawcing ding vuoi mah ci ka thei nadingun Pasien kungah ei dawhpieh in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempu pa in, “Lung nuomin pei un. Na nasep ding uh Topa’ mit in a en zing hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasal ngate pei-in Laish a tun ciengun tua sunga teng mite pen Sidon-te bang dan ma-in galmuongin daitah le ngaimuongtahin a om vua, leitungah bangma tasap nei loin a hauna uh a mukhie uhi. Tua tham loin Sidon-te tawh a kigamla vua, Aram-te tawh kizopna a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zorah le Eshtaol-a om a unaute kung a tun ciengun amate kungah, “Bang gen ding na nei vuoi?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in, “Hing pei un, amate sim dingin va kuonto ta vai; bang ding ahei cile a gam ka musa uh ahi a, hoi mama hi. Bang khat beh bawl sawm lo na hi uh amah? Pei ding kiheh sih un, lutin tua gam va luo ta vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na pei ciengun bangma a khophawh veteh lo mite kung na tung ding uhi. Tua gam a zai mama a- Pasien in na khut sung vuah tua gam ang pieh tahtah ahi hi- leitungah tasapna bangma khat beh a op lona mun khat ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zorah le Eshtaol panin galhiem tawi Dan-te be pasal zaguh a kuon vua, tuale
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amate peito-in Judah gam Kiriath-jearim munah giephuol a sat uhi. Tam thu ziehin tua mun Mahaneh-dan kici a, Kiriath-jearim nitumna lamah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum mun panin Ephraim muoltung gamah amate peisuohin Micah’ inn a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum gam (Laish a kici) endap dinga a pei pasal ngate in a kithuopi mite kungah, “Tam innte sungah siempu puon khat, teraphim, le a kisung sia milim khat a om lam na thei vuoi mah? Tua ahi ziehin tu-in na bawl ding uh ngaisun un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum lamah amate kihei-in Micah’ inna om tangvalpa Levi inn ah tungin ama a hopi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kulkotpi lutna-ah galhiem tawi Dan-te pasal za guh a din laitahun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />gam endap pasal ngate a sungah a lut vua, amate in sia kisung milim, siempu puon, le teraphim-te a la uhi. Galhiem a tawi pasal za guhte tawh kulkotpi lutna-ah siempupa a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Micah’ inn sungah tua pasalte lutin a kisung sia milim, siempu puon, le teraphim-te a lah ciengun siempupa in a kung vuah, “Bang bawl na hi vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in, “Ham sin! Na khutin na kam humin ei zui inlen, ka pa ule ka siempu uh hing hi ta’n. Nang adingin mi khat’ inn sunga siempu hi ding hoizaw amah, tua ahi sihle Israel-te sungah minam le be siempu hi ding hoizaw ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu pa in a ngetna uh a sang hi. Ama in siempu puon, teraphim, le milim-te la-in mite tawh a peiton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n amai vuah a tasente uh, a ganhonte ule a vante uh nuasie-in khuolzin a zom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Micah’ inn pan a gamla sim khat a tun ciengun Micah’ inn gei-a innte sunga om pasalte a kiciel vua, amate in Dan-te nuadelin a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in a kinuahei Dan-te awhsanin Micah kungah, “Tam bang mihonpi tawh nang pei nadingin bang thu om ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in dawngkia a, “Note in ka bawlsa ka pasien-te le ka siempu pa la-in a na peipi uhi, tuale ke’n bang nei lai ka hei? Tua ahile bang hangin, “Bang thu om ahei?”ci-in kei ei dong na hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dan-te in ama kungah, “Kote lahah na aw kizasah vet sin. Tua hi sihle a lungtom ka guolte in nang hing simin na hinna le na innkuon’ hinna na tan kha bep ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin a lampi vuah Dan-te a pei uhi. Micah in ama adingin amate thahat luo hi, ci-in a mu ciengin ama kihei-in a inn lam a zuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dan-te in Micah’ bawlsate le a siempu pa a lahpieh zaw ciengun a gamdai le a khophawh veteh lo mite opna Laish-ah a tung vua, namsau tawh amate vatin mei tawh khuopi a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sidon tawh kigamla-in Aram tawh kizopna a nei lo ziehun amate a hunkhie ding koima a om sih hi. Tua khuopi pen Beth-rehob te’ neisa kuom sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in khum khuopi pen Israel’ suon, amau’ pienna a pu uh Dan min tapin Dan ci uhi; ahi vangin nidang lai-in Laish khuo kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Dan-te in amate dingin milim a phut uhi. Moses’ tapa, Gershom’ tapa Jonathan le a tapate in salin tua gam a kipeipi masang dongin Dan-te dingin siempu a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n Shiloh ah Pasien’ biehbuh a om hun sung tungtawnin Micah’ bawlsa milim a kemcing uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Israel-te sungah kumpi om loin Ephraim muoltung gam monga a teng Levi-te khat in Judah gam Bethlehem panin a mei dingin numei khat a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hizongle a meinu ama tungah lungthahin Judah gam Bethlehem-a a pa’ inn ah nuatai a, khum tahah hla li sung bang a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin kam nemno tawh tua nu a hopi ding le a peipikia dingin a pasal a kuon hi. Ama in a nasempa le laa ni a zawpi hi. A pa’ inn ah a tun ciengin tua nu’ pa in ama mu-in lungdamna tawh a dawn dingin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sungpa, tua nu’ pa, in ama taamsah a, ama tawh ni thum sung a omton hi; tuaci’n an ne tui dawnin a om vua, tua munah ama a taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni li ni zingmawngin tho bai-in a pei dingin a kithawi uhi; hinanle a sungpa in a mahpa kungah, “An themkhat ne inlen na tha khausah phot in. Tua ciengin na pei na sih ding amah,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua mi nite to-in an ne tui dawnin a om uhi; tuale numeino’ pa in mipa kungah, “Tuzan giehkia ta unlen nuomtahin om un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pei dingin tua mipa a din ciengin a sungpa in a zan taamkia masangsie a hlo tentun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni nga ni zingmawngin a pei dingin ama thobai hi; tuale a sungpa in, “An ne phot tadi in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n nikai dongin ama gel a khawl vua, a ni gelin an ne tui dawnin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipa, a meinu le a nasempa a pei dingin a din ciengun a sungpa, numei nu’ pa in ama kungah, “En in, ni nai ta hi, khuomu ding ahi ta hi. Tuzan giehkia lai un. En in, ni a tum dihtah ta hi. Zan taam unlen nuomtahin omkia ta un. Zing cieng zingmawngin tho bai unlen na inn lam vuah pei un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle tua mipa zan taam nawn lo hi; ama dingin a pei a, Jebus khuo galkhatah (Jerusalem a cina) a tung hi. Ama a phaw kivaw laa ni le a meinu tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jebus khuo gei a phah ciengun ni tum dihtah a, a nasempa in a pu kungah, “Tun hing pei in, tam Jebus-te’ khuopi lamah kihei-in a sungah zan taam vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hizongle a pupa in ama kungah, “Israel mite-a’ ahi lo, gamdang mite’ khuopi sungah kihei-in i lut sih ding uhi; Gibeah lamah i peisuoh zaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nasempa kungah, “Pei vai, tam munte khat penpen i tun nading hanciemin, Gibeah ahi sihle Ramah ah zan taam vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n nawtsuohin a lampi vuah a pei uhi; tuale Benjamin-te’ gam Gibeah gei a tun tahun ni a tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gibeah ah pei-in a gieh dingin khum lamah a kihei uhi. Ama pei-in khuopi tuol-awngah a to a, ahi vangin koima in amate a inn vuah a tungsah nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin nitahin puvuoi lo kuon vai pei khat a om hi. Khum pa pen Ephraim muoltung gam pan ahi a, Gibeah ah a teng hi. (Khum muna tengte pen Benjamin-te ahi uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua puvuoi pa khuodah a, khuopi tuol-awng lai-a keng tawh khuolzin pa a mu ciengin ama in, “Hei-a haw ding na hi a, hei pana hing pei na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Judah gam Bethlehem panin Ephraim muoltung gam mong lam zuon dinga ang nawh ka hi uhi. Judah gam Bethlehem-a pei ka hi a, ka inn lam zuon ding ka hi hi. Koima in a inn ah ei tungsah nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ko na nasemte in ka laate dingun butu le gan-an, keima, numei nu le kang zawpi uh tangvalpa dingin zong moh le lenggazu ka nei vua, bangma ka kisam sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puvuoi pa in, “Na tungah nopna om taheh. Na kisap zosie kang bawlpieh ding hi. Tuol-awngah gieh vawt sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in inn ah amate zawpi-in a laate uh an pie hi; amate in a keng uh silin an ne tui dawnin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate a kiguolnop suo laitahun-khuopi sunga mi tatsie honkhat in tua inn a kui-im vua, a kotkhah a tum gawp uhi. Innteh puvuoi pa kungah, “Na inn sunga ang lut mipa ka luppi thei nadingun hing pusuohsah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Innteh pa pei-in a kung vuah, “Hi lo hi, ka sanggamte aw, tam bangin gamtat sie sih un. Tam mipa ka zinpa ahi ziehin tam bangin gamtat sie sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam sungah ka ta ngahnu le ama’ meinu a om hi; tu-in ama gel hing peipi vang. Ama gel buonin na dei bangun kibawl ta un; hinanle tam mipa tungah tua bangin gamtat sie malmal sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua mite in ama thu gen a ngai sih uhi. Tuaci’n tua pa in a meinu manin amate tungah a pie hi. Amate in tua nu buonin zan tungtawn khuova dongin a sauthang uhi. Amate in zingmawng phalva kisem pat tahin tua nu a peisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuo a vah bepin numei nu pei-in a pupa opna tua mipa’ inn kotbiengah nisuo dongin a pua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zingmawngin a pupa tho-in inn kotkhahte hong a, a pei dingin a kisa leh sangkil tungah a khut ngamin inn kotkhahah a lum a meinu a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in tua nu kungah, “Tho in, pei ta vai,” a ci hi. Hinanle ama in a dawng sih hi. Tua ciengin ama in a laa tungah tua nu a puo hi; tuale a inn lam a zuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Inn a tun ciengin ama in nam khat la-in a meinu tu-in a phei a liengin se sawm le se ni suo-in semnen a, Israel gam zosie-ah a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a mi sawlte kungah, “Israel-te zosie tungah, ‘Egypt gam panin Israel-te a peito vua kipan tuni dongin tam bang thu a pieng ngai ta amah? Tam thu ngaisun un, kikum unlen genkhie un,’ na ci ding uhi,” ci-in amate thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te zosie, Dan panin Beer-sheba dong, Gilead gam zong a kihal, a kuon vua, Topa mai Mizpah ah kengkhatkhai bangin mihonpi a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel minam zosie sung panin mipi makai zosie a kikhawm vua, namsau a tawi keng-galkap tul zali, Pasien’ mite kikhopna-ah amate mama a kipie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Tu-in Benjamin-te in Mizpah ah Israel-te a peito zo lam a za uhi.) Israel-te in, “Ei gen un, bangci dan a tam tatsietna hing pieng ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kithat numei nu’ pasal Levi-pa in dawng a, “Benjamin-te’ gam Gibeah ah a zangie dingin keima le ka meinu ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeah uliente ang kuonto vua, zan lai-in ka tunna inn ei kui-im uhi. Amate in kei tha ei sawm vua, a si dongin ka meinu a buon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka meinu la-in ka semnen a, Israel-te’ luo gam sung zosie-ah kang hawm hi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in Israel gam sungah a kidahhuoi le a mothuoi na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n no Israel-te zosie aw, tu-in na ngaisutna uh gen unlen tam sungah kikum un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi zosie kengkhatkhai bangin a ding pai vua, “I puonbuhte-ah koima khat zong pei loin, koima khat zong inn lamah i kilekia sih ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in Gibeah tunga i bawl ding uh tam bang ahi hi: Tua khuo sim dingin aisanna tawh i kuonto ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel gama a na gamtatsa uh mindaina teng zosie ziehin Benjamin-te’ gam Gibeah a thuhkia ding ahi galkapte’ anneh tuidawn a puo dingin Israel minam zosie sung panin mi zakhat lahah sawm khat, tulkhat lahah zakhat, tul sawm lahah tulkhat i la ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n khuopi sim dingin Israel mite zosie mihing khat bangin kithutuohin a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin minam zosie kungah Israel minamte in mi sawlin, “Note lahah na bawl uh mawna bang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ziehin kote in tu-in amate thatin Israel sung pan sietna ka hepkhiet thei nadingun Gibeah-a mi ginalote ei pie un,” a ci uhi. Ahi vangin Benjamin-te in a unau Israel-te’ thu gen a ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-te tungah gal bawlin a kuon dingin khuopite panin Benjamin-te a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum ni-in Benjamin-te in a khuopite uh panin Gibeah-a a teng mite banah namsau tawi mi tul sawmni le tulguh a khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam galkap zosiete lah pana kituomtel a veilawng mi zasagi a om hi; amate pen a unpi-un suongtang tawh samzam kapin a khiel lote ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel-te in Benjamin-te simlo, namsau tawi thei galkap mihing tul zali a khawm vua, a unpi-un galsiem mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethel kato dingin Israel-te a peisuoh vua, “Benjamin-te sim dingin koi pen kuonto masa ding ka hi uh hei?” ci-in khum munah Pasien a dong uhi. Topa in, “Judah kuonto masa ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te zingmawngin tho-in Gibeah khuo sim dingin giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Benjamin-te sim dingin Israel-te a peito uhi; tuale Benjamin-te sim dingin Israel-te in Gibeah ah panmun a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gibeah panin Benjamin-te kuonin tua ni-in Israel-te tul sawmni le tulni a satlia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />(23) Israel-te kuonto-in Topa mai-ah nitah dongin a kap uhi. Amate in Topa a dong vua, “Ka unau Benjamin-te tawh gal kisim dingin ka va naikia ta ding vuoi mah?” a ci uhi. Topa in, “Amate sim dingin kuonto un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />(22) Israel-te kihansuo-in a ni masa ni-a a panmun ma vuah gal a pangkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n a ni ni ni-in Benjamin-te sim dingin Israel-te mai nawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ni ni ni-in amate sim dingin Gibeah panin Benjamin-te kuonkhie-in Israel-te mi tul sawm le tulgiet a satlia vua, amate a unpi-un namsau tawite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin a galkap buppi-un Israel-te zosie Bethel-ah kilekia-in tua mun Topa mai-ah to-in a kap uhi; amate in tua ni nitah dongin an a tang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel-te in Topa a dong vua, (azieh pen khum hun lai-in tua munah Pasien’ thukham singkuong om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aaron’ tapa Eleazar’ tapa Phinehas in khum hunin tua mai-ah na a sem hi), “Ka unau uh Benjamin-te sim dingin khatvei kuonkia lai ding ka hi uh amah, tua ahi sihle khawl ding ka hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi. Topa in dawng a, “Kuonto un, azieh pen zing ciengin na khut sung vuah amate kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te in Gibeah kimkotah a buhdap dingin mi a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin a ni thum ni-in Benjamin-te sim dingin Israel-te a kuonto vua, a masa-a bangin Gibeah langkhatah panmun a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Galkapte do dinga Benjamin-te a kuon ciengin khuopi panin amate kipeikhiesah hi. A masa-a bangin amate in galkapte liemsahin thalup a kipan vua, Bethel lama a peito pen le Gibeah lama a pei lamlienpi dung teng, le gamzang lai-ah Israel-te sawmthum bang a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamin-te in, “A masa-a bangin i mai vuah amate kizo ta hi,” ci-in a ngaisun uhi. Hinanle Israel-te in, “Nuakin vai-in khuopi panin lamlien lamah amate peisah vai,” a kici ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Geba nitumna lam panin a budap Israel mite a nawtai laitahun, Baal-tamar ah Israel mite a nuatawn vua, gal sim dingin panmun a lakia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gibeah khuo a sim dingin Israel-te zosie sung panin a kituomtel mi tul sawm a kuon vua, gal kidona a nasie mama hi. Ahi vangin Benjamin-te in amate tungah gimna a tun baih lam ding a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel-te mai-ah Topa in Benjamin-te a zo hi; khum ni-in Israel-te in Benjamin-te tul sawmni le tulnga le zakhat a that vua, a unpi-un namsau tawite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Benjamin-te a guollel lam a kithei uhi. Benjamin-te in mun a awn uhi, azieh pen Israel-te in Gibeah sim dinga a koi uh a buhdap galkapte a muong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A buhdap galkapte zong nawpei-in Gibeah a bulu uhi. Tua ciengin khuopi sunga om mite zosie namsau tawh a satlia sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu-in Israel mite le a buhdapte kikalah thukimna khat om a, amate in khuopi sung panin meikhu lompi a suosah to ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />gal sim dingin Israel mipite kiheikia ding uhi. Ahi vangin Benjamin-te in Israel-te liemsahin thalia ding a kipan uhi; mihing sawmthum bang a that uhi; tuaci’n amate in, “Kido masah lai-a bangin i mai vuah amate kizo tahtah ta hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuopi panin meikhu lompi meilum bangin kato dinga a kipat ciengin Benjamin-te a kinua hei vua, tuale a khuopi buppi katumin vantung lamah meikhu kato a mu uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel mite a kihei vua, Benjamin-te a lungkie uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate tungah gimna a tun ding hun a nai lam a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel-te kung panin amate kinuale-in gamlah a manaw uhi; ahi vangin gal in amate a nuaphah a, khuopi pana a pusuoh mite in a kikal sung tengah amate a that sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Amate in Benjamin-te a that vua, Nohah panin Gibeah nisuona mun dongah amate delin a tuoncil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin-te mi tul sawm le tulgiet a si vua, a unpi-in galhang vive ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amate kihei-in senel gam lam Rimmon suongpi zuonin a tai vua, lamlienpi dungah mi tul nga kisatlia a, Gidom dongin kidelin mi tulni kithat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-in namsau tawi a kithat Benjamin-te zosie tul sawmni le tul nga pha a, a unpi-un galhang vive ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanle mi zaguh kihei-in senel gam Rimmon lam zuonin a tai vua, Rimmon suongpi-ah hla li sung a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Benjamin-te sim dingin Israel-te kilekia-in namsau tawh a khuopi, a mihing le a ganhingin a om zosie a vatlia uhi. A omlai khuopite zong mei tawh a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Mizpah ah Israel-te a kiciem zo ta vua, “Koima khat beh in i tanute uh Benjamin-te tawh i kinungsah sih ding uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale Bethel ah mite pei-in khum sunga Pasien mai-ah amate nitah dong to-in nahpitahin a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, “Israel-te’ Pasien, Topa aw, tuni-in Israel-te sungah minam khat a pelem nadingin tam thu bang dinga hing pieng ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zing ciengin mite tho bai-in tua munah maitam khat a lam vua, meihal biehna le thunuom biehpiehnate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in, “Israel minamte zosie sung panin Topa kunga kikhopna ah koi teng hing pei lo ahei?” a ci uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa kunga a pei lo mite tawh kisai-in Mizpah ah kiciemna lienpi khat a bawl vua, “Tua mipa kithat ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle Israel-te in a unau uh Benjamin dingin a laina vua, “Tuni-in Israel sung panin minam khat a kihemkhie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau’ zi dingin i tanute pie sih vai ci-in Topa tungah i kiciem zo tah ziehun eite in a hinglaite ading zi bangci guot ding i hi uh ahei? a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua bepin amate in, “ Topa kung Mizpah ah Israel minamte ang pei lo a om ei?” a ci uhi. Amate in Jabesh-gilead panin kikhopna giephuolah koima khat beh a pei lo lam a phawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen mite lahah min a kihlat ciengin khum munah Jabesh-gilead khuo-a tengte khat zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum sungah mihonte in galkap mihing tul sawm le tulni a sawl vua, “Pei unlen Jabesh-gilead khuo-a tengte, namsau tawh nupite le naupang neute tawh va that ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam bangin na bawl ding uhi; pasal zosie le pasal tawh a lumtonsa numei zosie na sumaimang ding uhi,” ci-in thu pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jabesh-gilead khuo-a tengte lahah pasal tawh a lumton ngai nai lo ngahnu siengtho zali a mu vua, Canaan gam sunga a om Shiloh giephuolah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin mihonte in Rimmon suongpi-a om Benjamin-te kungah thu a puoh vua, amate tungah kilemna thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khum hunin Benjamin-te kilekia-in Jabesh-glead numei a hingkhawite uh amate a pie uhi; hizongle amate adingin numei kicing zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in Israel minam sungah kikhenkehna a opsah ziehin Benjamin-te tungah mite in lainatna a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihonpi upate in, “Benjamin-te sungah numei om nawn lo ahi ziehin a hinglaite zi bangci guot ding i hei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale amate in, “Israel-te sung panin minam khat a manthai lo nadingin a hinglai Benjamin-te adingin gamhluo a op lo phamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite in lah amau’ zi dingin i tanute i pie thei ta sih uhi,” a ci uhi. Azieh pen Israel-te a kiciemzo ta vua, “Benjamin-te tawh a tanu kinungsah poma in samsietna thuoh taheh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in, “En un, Bethel sah lam, Bethel panin Shechem peitona lamlienpi nisuona lam, Lebonah leitaw lama om Shiloh ah Topa adingin kumsim pawi bawlna om hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in Benjamin-te thu hil in, “Va pei-in lengga lote-ah va kibuhdap ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lamvui lahah Shiloh nungahte a lam dinga ang pei ciengin, lengga lote panin pusuohin na zi dingun khat ciet man unlen Benjamin gamah peipi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka kung vuah a pate ahi sihle a sanggamte hing pei-in ei mawsah leh amate kungah, ‘Nohaw hing kiphal mai unlen amate zi ei guonsah un; bangzieh ahei cile mikim zi ding gal sungah ka matpieh zo sih uhi. Ahi vangin note in na tanute uh amate tawh na kinunsah uh hi sam lo ahi ziehin no zong na maw tuom sih uhi,’ ka ci ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua bangin Benjamin-te a gamta uhi; amate in a laamte lah panin numei khat ciet zi dingin manin a taipi uhi. Tua ciengin amate pei-in a gam vuah a kilekia vua, khuopite lam phakia-in tuate sungah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum hunin amau’ minam le a innkuonpi ciet tawh khum panin Israel-te a pei vua, khum panin a gam ciet a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Israel-te sungah kumpi om lo hi; amau’ hoisah bangin mi zosie a gamta uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
